sage":"fix(utils): Improve `getType` name resolution\n\nImprove `getType()` handling for functions and classes\nwhen `nameOnly` is enabled.\n\n- Add function/class name resolution using `fn.name`\n- Fallback to parsing `Function.prototype.toString`\n- Return `(anonymous)` for unnamed functions/classes\n- Preserve primitive and object tag behavior\n- Add extensive JSDoc examples and edge-case notes\n- Clarify `null` handling and `typeof` limitations\n\nThis improves runtime consistency across Node.js and\nmodern JavaScript runtimes while preserving compatibility\nwith Node.js v14.","tree":{"sha":"eea33d78f31811ca39bb857de553230997b6d36f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitsuki31/tguard-js/git/trees/eea33d78f31811ca39bb857de553230997b6d36f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitsuki31/tguard-js/git/commits/adf92f1bdf9ea9bf1bdbfd222609123a58073c51","verification":{"payload":"tree eea33d78f31811ca39bb857de553230997b6d36f\nparent bb82ee5ea63a693f56370af3d5a17257a349dc0f\nauthor Ryuu Mitsuki <dhefam31@proton.me> 1778164930 +0700\ncommitter Ryuu Mitsuki <dhefam31@proton.me> 1778165386 +0700\n\nfix(utils): Improve `getType` name resolution\n\nImprove `getType()` handling for functions and classes\nwhen `nameOnly` is enabled.\n\n- Add function/class name resolution using `fn.name`\n- Fallback to parsing `Function.prototype.toString`\n- Return `(anonymous)` for unnamed functions/classes\n- Preserve primitive and object tag behavior\n- Add extensive JSDoc examples and edge-case notes\n- Clarify `null` handling and `typeof` limitations\n\nThis improves runtime consistency across Node.js and\nmodern JavaScript runtimes while preserving compatibility\nwith Node.js v14.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEm92tubt+kYpkGEDs6coHz6zDdJoFAmn8pooACgkQ6coHz6zD\ndJoo0Q/7BdgsiAOd1G6y9kiiVwsgk46qkYjcEU7RrJp7zjh7e2qT9xvYA7fAHmgB\nDpfD5+EoGqksTfvvIP05D67Nf4tUo+56iMhExUninVie0nQgNi9j+GjDSTCUJ3rM\nB2EwCZa8vGrzjCkR/yh0BFFrXwBuqeyaoJqIxHGR7pOFv3