/api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/a099ccc8f8207e218998c8281c37f315455b844e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T17:10:34Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T18:30:48Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"Phase 7: Student services catalog, request hub fixes, Kanban & action-required\n\n- Fix request-status contract bug: statuses are integer enums (no\n  JsonStringEnumConverter); add requestStatus.js with REQUEST/PAYMENT/SERVICE\n  enums + labels + badge classes. StatusBadge now resolves int enums by type.\n- Fix RequestTimeline: read backend fields (performedAt, performedByRole) and\n  render readable action labels (was reading non-existent date/performedBy).\n- MyRequests: integer status filter + table/Kanban view toggle (board grouped\n  by status).\n- StudentRequestDetails: surface MoreInfoRequired as an \"action required\"\n  banner with the latest staff note + respond link; payment shown as badge+EGP.\n- New /student/services catalog page: search, filter by type + paid/free,\n  sort by name/price; + Services menu item (LayoutGrid icon).\n\nDeferred (flagged): real-time SignalR (7.4) — backend hub exists but needs a\nnew @microsoft/signalr dep and a running backend to test. ServiceDto has no\ncategory/processingTime/requirements fields (frontend previously assumed them).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a8af21e