5b844e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/70f76c08300bacd57a03180c5e527acbc03bc47e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T16:18:11Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T18:30:48Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"Phase 6: Student Treasury payment flow (fees -> order -> gateway)\n\nReplaces the legacy invoice-based student payments page with the documented\nHU Treasury model (docs/payment/): StudentFee -> Order -> Payment.\n\n- treasuryPaymentService: fees/orders reads, createOrder, initiateOrder,\n  cancelOrder; FeeStatus/OrderStatus/Gateway enums + labels\n- usePayments hooks: useStudentFees, useStudentOrders, useOrderPolling\n  (polls until terminal), useCreateOrder, useCancelOrder\n- StudentPaymentsPage rebuilt: summary (outstanding/in-order/paid/total),\n  Pay Fees tab (select pending fees -> gateway picker -> create order ->\n  initiate session -> redirect), Orders tab (status, continue/cancel)\n- PaymentReturn page (/student/payments/return): polls the order after the\n  gateway redirect and shows paid/failed/pending; recovers orderId from query\n  or checkout stash\n- gateways: Mastercard / Bank Misr / eFinance\n\nDeferred (no backend/model, flagged as gaps): installment plans, scholarship/\ndiscount display, client receipt PDF. Legacy invoice services remain for the\nadmin finance dashboard.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"65448819f5d7f9ffc93736dd4c8ee2a42767cf64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/65448819f5d7f9ffc93736dd4c8ee2a42767cf64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/70f76c08300bacd57a03180c5e527acbc03bc47e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/70f76c083