capu-portal/commit/1ed368fa84dc820e788c04e6fbe98af4d9b58e07","sha":"1ed368fa84dc820e788c04e6fbe98af4d9b58e07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/1ed368fa84dc820e788c04e6fbe98af4d9b58e07"}],"sha":"b73b07255e64ee34a16ffce223e03f813abe47f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/b73b07255e64ee34a16ffce223e03f813abe47f9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/1ed368fa84dc820e788c04e6fbe98af4d9b58e07/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T14:51:14Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T14:51:14Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"Phase 4: Read-only academic features (registered courses, grades, GPA projection, catalog)\n\nPer docs/Courses/Registration_Model.md the portal does NOT manage course\nregistration — registration data is read-only and synchronized from external\nsystems. So this phase builds the documented read-only surface and explicitly\nomits the spec''s enrollment cart/submit, registration state machine, and\nwaitlist (which contradict the model and have no backend).\n\n- Services: registrationService (/courses/registered, /history,\n  /{courseId}/attempts) and gradeService (/grades/summary, /history) plus\n  client-side GPA helpers (computeGpa, projectCgpa on a 4.0 scale).\n- StudentCourses: replaced the offerings listing (a spec-noted bug — it showed\n  offerings, not the student''s registrations) with real registered courses +\n  semester history + status badges, via TanStack Query.\n- StudentGrades: replaced the GRADE_DATA mock with the real academic summary\n  (CGPA/GPA/credits/standing) + grade history + per-semester breakdown, and\n  added a client-side GPA \"what-if\" projection for in-progress courses.\n- CourseRegistration repurposed into a read-only Course Catalog (debounced\n  /courses/search) with an explicit \"registration is external\" note.\n- Fixed the dashboard ProfileWidget to read the real cgpa field.\n\nTests: computeGpa / projectCgpa unit tests. Frontend suite 20/20; build clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c20ef2c83d87eb0cdc470add62a00d736ec245e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/c20ef2c83d87eb0cdc470add62a00d736ec245e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/1ed368fa84dc820e788c04e6fbe98af4d9b58e07","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/1ed368fa84dc820e788c04e6fbe98af4d9b58e07","node_id":"C_kwDOSUM_ZtoAKDFlZDM2OGZhODRkYzgyMGU3ODhjMDRlNmZiZTk4YWY0ZDliNThlMDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/f7b67183aa61e83343f70a51022ce03bc4e422ca","sha":"f7b67183aa61e83343f70a51022ce03bc4e422ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/f7b67183aa61e83343f70a51022ce03bc4e422ca"}],"sha":"1ed368fa84dc820e788c04e6fbe98af4d9b58e07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/1ed368fa84dc820e788c04e6fbe98af4d9b58e07"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/f7b67183aa61e83343f70a51022ce03bc4e422ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T13:54:29Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T13:54:29Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"Phase 3: Dashboard & command center overhaul (TanStack Query, widgets, drag-drop)\n\nRebuild the student dashboard per docs/MASTER_SPECIFICATION.md Phase 3.\nFrontend-only — all widget data comes from existing endpoints.\n\n- Data layer: replace every useEffect/useState fetch with TanStack Query\n  hooks (useAcademicOverview, useAvailableServices, useGradesSummary,\n  useFinancialSnapshot, useTodaySchedule, useUnreadNotifications) — cached,\n  with retry/refetch and defensive parsing.\n- Widget architecture: WidgetShell provides the four canonical async states\n  (skeleton / error+retry / empty / content) for seven memoized widgets\n  (Profile, Stats, Action Center, Schedule, Financial, Quick Links,\n  Services). Theme-token driven (dark-mode aware) and i18n-ready via\n  t(key, { defaultValue }).\n- Customization: @dnd-kit/sortable grid (first use in the app) with a\n  Customize mode to reorder, show/hide, and reset widgets. Layout persists to\n  Zustand + localStorage (useDashboardLayoutStore); hydrate is\n  forward-compatible (drops unknown keys, appends new widgets).\n- Animations: staggered fade-slide mount, useCountUp number counters\n  (easeOutCubic), progress-bar fill — all gated behind prefers-reduced-motion.\n- StudentDashboard reduced to a greeting + the grid.\n\nTests: useDashboardLayoutStore hydrate/persist/reset. Frontend suite 13/13;\nbuild clean (2231 modules).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd70a89bd7ebd04fdc1455cd33279f96bc26b8ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/dd70a89bd7ebd04fdc1455cd33279f96bc26b8ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/f7b67183aa61e83343f70a51022ce03bc4e422ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/f7b67183aa61e83343f70a51022ce03bc4e422ca","node_id":"C_kwDOSUM_ZtoAKGY3YjY3MTgzYWE2MWU4MzM0M2Y3MGE1MTAyMmNlMDNiYzRlNDIyY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/286feccf17a14c77e76612935bb4633f8d02bf7c","sha":"286feccf17a14c77e76612935bb4633f8d02bf7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/286feccf17a14c77e76612935bb4633f8d02bf7c"}],"sha":"f7b67183aa61e83343f70a51022ce03bc4e422ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/f7b67183aa61e83343f70a51022ce03bc4e422ca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/286feccf17a14c77e76612935bb4633f8d02bf7c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T11:37:51Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T11:37:51Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"Phase 2: Student blocker middleware (password change + profile completeness)\n\nInterstitial \"blocker\" gate for the student portal per\ndocs/MASTER_SPECIFICATION.md Phase 2, grounded in the real profile model\n(no invented backend). Scoped to password-change + profile-completeness; the\nmandatory-actions/surveys engine is intentionally deferred.\n\n- StudentBlockerGate wraps /student/* routes inside DashboardLayout.\n  Precedence: requiresPasswordChange -> profile incomplete -> mandatory\n  action (the last always false until the surveys subsystem exists).\n- requiresPasswordChange (from Phase 1) renders a forced, non-dismissable\n  ChangePasswordModal; changing the password revokes the session so the\n  student returns to login. ChangePasswordModal gains a `forced` mode.\n- useBlockerState derives completeness from the existing profile-records\n  (EmergencyContact) plus the Student core record (phone + address). The\n  required-field set is a single editable config (REQUIRED_PROFILE_FIELDS).\n  Fails OPEN on error or missing student id so a student is never trapped.\n- CompleteProfileWizard: 2-step (contact -> emergency contact), persists via\n  the existing updateStudent + upsertProfileRecord and invalidates the gate\n  query on completion.\n- Tests: buildCompleteness unit tests (empty, complete, whitespace,\n  malformed JSON, non-emergency records). Frontend suite 9/9.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2fa3280afcbf32c780b0fd17c1a6fd0b9390a86c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/2fa3280afcbf32c780b0fd17c1a6fd0b9390a86c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/286feccf17a14c77e76612935bb4633f8d02bf7c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/286feccf17a14c77e76612935bb4633f8d02bf7c","node_id":"C_kwDOSUM_ZtoAKDI4NmZlY2NmMTdhMTRjNzdlNzY2MTI5MzViYjQ2MzNmOGQwMmJmN2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/aa08a98417b7eba1f135b62316a33055f3c3c0d4","sha":"aa08a98417b7eba1f135b62316a33055f3c3c0d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/aa08a98417b7eba1f135b62316a33055f3c3c0d4"}],"sha":"286feccf17a14c77e76612935bb4633f8d02bf7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/286feccf17a14c77e76612935bb4633f8d02bf7c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/aa08a98417b7eba1f135b62316a33055f3c3c0d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T11:10:06Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T11:10:06Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"Phase 1: Authentication enhancements (login validation, expiry flag, sessions, forgot-password)\n\nFrontend and backend work for docs/MASTER_SPECIFICATION.md Phase 1, keeping\nthe existing AuthContext (no Zustand migration) per the additive approach.\nPayments/first-login enforcement deferred per the documented models.\n\nFrontend (1.3 / 1.5):\n- LoginForm migrated to react-hook-form + zod. Student logins validate the\n  14-digit Egyptian National ID; admin/staff stay lenient to avoid lockout.\n  Login only checks password presence (complexity is enforced on change).\n- ChangePasswordModal policy hardened to 8+ with upper/lower/digit/symbol\n  (it was already wired to /auth/change-password).\n- apiClient short-circuits a session_revoked 401 to logout (no futile\n  refresh) and redirects with ?session=revoked; idle auto-logout uses\n  ?session=expired; LoginForm shows a notice for both.\n- passwordExpiryDate / requiresPasswordChange threaded through authService\n  and AuthContext (additive state). Enforcement UI deferred to Phase 2.\n\nBackend (approved in-scope changes):\n- LoginResponseDto / RefreshTokenResponseDto surface PasswordExpiryDate and\n  RequiresPasswordChange. Expired passwords no longer hard-fail login; the\n  client is flagged to force a change instead (still audited).\n- SessionVersionMiddleware returns {reason:\"session_revoked\"} in the 401 body.\n- Forgot-password (full build): PasswordResetToken entity + EF config + DbSet,\n  IPasswordResetService/PasswordResetService, IPasswordResetSender with a\n  LoggingPasswordResetSender (logs the link — no email infra yet),\n  SetPasswordAsync on the credential resolver, and anonymous\n  /auth/forgot-password + /auth/reset-password endpoints. Reset consumes a\n  single-use token, sets the password, and revokes all sessions.\n- Frontend: ForgotPasswordModal simplified to National ID and wired up; new\n  ResetPassword page at /reset-password.\n\nNOTE: PasswordResetTokens is a new table. With EnsureCreated (no migrations)\nthe dev database must be dropped & recreated to pick it up. Set\nAuthentication:PasswordReset:ResetUrlBase per environment.\n\nTests: AuthenticationServiceTests updated for the expiry-flag contract; new\nPasswordResetServiceTests. Authentication suite 61/61; frontend 4/4.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2e75040ea2796b299e15856964b20af670c03234","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/2e75040ea2796b299e15856964b20af670c03234"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/aa08a98417b7eba1f135b62316a33055f3c3c0d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/aa08a98417b7eba1f135b62316a33055f3c3c0d4","node_id":"C_kwDOSUM_ZtoAKGFhMDhhOTg0MTdiN2ViYTFmMTM1YjYyMzE2YTMzMDU1ZjNjM2MwZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/ee5ae8ee7ef8f2b8022a6f80ee558ffb947259c6","sha":"ee5ae8ee7ef8f2b8022a6f80ee558ffb947259c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/ee5ae8ee7ef8f2b8022a6f80ee558ffb947259c6"}],"sha":"aa08a98417b7eba1f135b62316a33055f3c3c0d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/aa08a98417b7eba1f135b62316a33055f3c3c0d4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/ee5ae8ee7ef8f2b8022a6f80ee558ffb947259c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T11:08:41Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T11:08:41Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"Fix stale Core.UniTests compile errors\n\nAlign three test files with current authorization APIs so the unit-test\nproject compiles again (it was blocking the whole suite from running):\n\n- PermissionLookupCacheTests / PermissionManagementServiceTests: RolesToAdd\n  and RolesToRemove are now List<RoleScopeAssignment>, not List<Guid>.\n- PermissionManagementServiceTests: PermissionAssignmentResponse exposes\n  RoleAssignments (List<RoleAssignmentInfo>), not RoleIds.\n- RolesControllerEndpointTests: RolesController now also takes\n  AddRoleMemberCommandHandler and RemoveRoleMemberCommandHandler.\n\nCompile-only changes; no production code touched. Unrelated pre-existing\nruntime failures (DataSeeder/Staff/Student/Structure) remain and are\ntracked separately.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f34155fbc173e59576e28ed98cc4f2d23ac98a3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/f34155fbc173e59576e28ed98cc4f2d23ac98a3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/ee5ae8ee7ef8f2b8022a6f80ee558ffb947259c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/ee5ae8ee7ef8f2b8022a6f80ee558ffb947259c6","node_id":"C_kwDOSUM_ZtoAKGVlNWFlOGVlN2VmOGYyYjgwMjJhNmY4MGVlNTU4ZmZiOTQ3MjU5YzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/ed819ccacaf90db39398adcbca96833bbaca9e7f","sha":"ed819ccacaf90db39398adcbca96833bbaca9e7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/ed819ccacaf90db39398adcbca96833bbaca9e7f"}],"sha":"ee5ae8ee7ef8f2b8022a6f80ee558ffb947259c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/ee5ae8ee7ef8f2b8022a6f80ee558ffb947259c6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/ed819ccacaf90db39398adcbca96833bbaca9e7f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T10:06:47Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T10:07:32Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"Phase 0: Foundation audit & tech-debt elimination\n\nFrontend cleanup and foundation work per docs/MASTER_SPECIFICATION.md Phase 0.\n\n- 0.1 Dead code: strip 875-line commented block from i18n.js; trim App.css\n  to live rules; remove dead duplicate modules/auth (real auth is core/auth);\n  remove empty modules.config.js and Vite template svgs; drop unused\n  AdminLogin import in CTASection (was breaking the build).\n- 0.3 CSS: add core/styles/tokens.css (centralized design tokens, semantic\n  aliases, radius/shadow/transition scales, dark mode) and print.css; wire\n  into main.jsx; remove duplicated :root from index.css; theme-aware body.\n- 0.4 Env: add .env.example/.development/.production (payments via backend\n  Treasury integration, not a separate frontend gateway).\n- 0.5 Docs: rewrite frontend README; fix root README stale Vue 3 -> React 19\n  stack and broken doc links.\n- 0.2 Dependency audit: no bumps needed (dnd-kit core6/sortable10 and\n  resolvers5/RHF7 are compatible pairings, not mismatches).\n\nVerified: npm run build (2150 modules) and npm run test (4/4) pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9ee972db4325db53b20e7efae1a98036a9cde036","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/9ee972db4325db53b20e7efae1a98036a9cde036"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/ed819ccacaf90db39398adcbca96833bbaca9e7f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https:/