dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ziad-aladawy-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ziad-aladawy-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ziad-aladawy-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/b6d9f763398649a5bcd78dc91219cd552205243a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T09:05:35Z","email":"ziad.aladawy.dev@gmail.com","name":"Ziad Aladawy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T09:05:35Z","email":"ziad.aladawy.dev@gmail.com","name":"Ziad Aladawy"},"message":"Add master spec, course module scaffolding, docker fixes\n\nAdd a comprehensive MASTER_SPECIFICATION.md with the full product blueprint and roadmap. Introduce new course-related scaffolding (constants, hooks, validators, locales) and utilities to support course forms, prerequisites and course list behavior. Update several frontend query/hooks/pages for academic plans, course offerings and schedule slots, and adjust CoursesPage and ScheduleSlotsPage accordingly. Fix docker-compose port mappings for SQL Server and Redis (map to their standard ports). Also update backend DataSeeder.cs to reflect seed data changes.","tree":{"sha":"2c87401412921ca82af6c94ab54a63f330fc9003","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/2c87401412921ca82af6c94ab54a63f330fc9003"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/b6d9f763398649a5bcd78dc91219cd552205243a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208118421?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ziad-aladawy-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ziad-aladawy-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ziad-aladawy-dev/following{/other