ion: the authz entity\n  Core.Domain.Authorization.Module is shadowed by the newer\n  CapitalUniversity.Module.* namespace when referenced from a\n  CapitalUniversity.* test namespace. Add a `using Module = ...` alias\n  declared inside the file-scoped namespace (so it resolves before the\n  outer namespace) to the 6 affected files across Contract.Tests and\n  Core.UniTests.\n- ILocalizationService gained GetLocalizedString(string?); implement it in\n  the two test doubles (TestLocalizationService, PassthroughLocalization).\n- Drop a stale `Core.Application.DTOs.UniversityStructure` using (the DTOs\n  now live under Core.Abstractions.UniversityStructure.DTOs).\n\nContract.Tests now builds clean. Core.UniTests is down to the 3 stale\nStudentServices test files (against the removed pre-rewrite API), addressed\nseparately.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"43b6f0cefb6096a06af6925b45663652db3c96de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/43b6f0cefb6096a06af6925b45663652db3c96de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/9628d94203fea5d76a8463218090081984ae54bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/9628d94203fea5d76a8463218090081984ae54bb","node_id":"C_kwDOSUM_ZtoAKDk2MjhkOTQyMDNmZWE1ZDc2YTg0NjMyMTgwOTAwODE5ODRhZTU0YmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/4b40a1721b29ba08bfe1aeb371bb9681b379a976","sha":"4b40a1721b29ba08bfe1aeb371bb9681b379a976","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/4b40a1721b29ba08bfe1aeb371bb9681b379a976"}],"sha":"9628d94203fea5d76a8463218090081984ae54bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/9628d94203fea5d76a8463218090081984ae54bb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/4b40a1721b29ba08bfe1aeb371bb9681b379a976/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T22:30:06Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T22:30:06Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"Fix build: port payments seeder to Treasury model, drop dead handler\n\nThe detached checkout at origin/main (61dda3c) failed to build. Two root\ncauses, both from the treasury-payments overhaul leaving stragglers:\n\n- Remove StudentServices FeePaidEventHandler: it referenced an unbuilt API\n  (IStudentServiceRequest{Repository,Service}, GetByPaymentReferenceAsync,\n  ConfirmPaymentAsync) and a PaymentReferenceId that never existed, and was\n  not registered in DI.\n- Port MassiveDataSeeder.ExpandPaymentsAsync off the removed Invoice model\n  onto the Treasury graph (TreasuryReceipt -> StudentFee -> Order -> Payment\n  -> PaymentTransaction), preserving every amount, Arabic description, date,\n  gateway and status. PartiallyPaid (no Treasury equivalent) maps to a\n  Pending fee; the failed-attempt case maps to a Pending fee plus a failed\n  Order + audit transaction.\n\nAlso includes pre-existing working-tree changes: drop the deleted legacy\nPaymentsSeeder wiring from Program.cs, and add the Payments.Abstractions\nproject reference to the StudentServices csproj.\n\nThe API and all production projects build clean (0 warnings/errors). The\nCore.UniTests and Contract.Tests projects still have pre-existing failures\n(stale StudentServices tests, a Module type/namespace collision, and an\nILocalizationService signature change) to be addressed separately.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"807a271faf7411566dbd8c3514900193001cf87b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/807a271faf7411566dbd8c3514900193001cf87b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/4b40a1721b29ba08bfe1aeb371bb9681