public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/7fc9bb2724a33b26267e63808a1da9637063c93c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T10:30:52Z","email":"ziad.aladawy.dev@gmail.com","name":"Ziad Aladawy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T10:30:52Z","email":"ziad.aladawy.dev@gmail.com","name":"Ziad Aladawy"},"message":"Add PermissionGate & BulkActionBar, UI updates\n\nIntroduce permission utilities and bulk action UI, plus broad frontend & backend updates.\n\nFrontend: add PermissionGate (and PermissionGateWithLevel) and a new BulkActionBar component; enhance Breadcrumbs linking/labels; extend CommandPalette quick pages; revamp ScopeModal with searchable temporal dropdowns and layout/CSS tweaks; remove legacy UserDetailView and wire DirectoryPage to use PermissionGate and direct user routes; add permissionResource to directory configs; add many new pages/routes/styles (audit logs, programs, sync, transactions, student services, profile records, etc.).\n\nBackend: add migration to add staff/student profile columns, update DTOs, services, controllers and seeders, and add role-member command handlers and student-services permission manifest to support the UI changes.\n\nThese changes enable role-based UI gating, improved scope selection UX, and add several new admin pages and data model support for staff/student profiles.","tree":{"sha":"ab164dfc6e5dbbfa24f07e099f3ee59e63371143","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/ab164dfc6e5dbbfa24f07e099f3ee59e63371143"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/7fc9bb2724a33b26267e63808a1da9637063c93c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208118421?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ziad-aladawy-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ziad-aladawy-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ziad-aladawy-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ziad-aladawy-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev","id":208118421,"login":"ziad-aladawy-dev","node_id":"U_kgDODGeilQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ziad-aladawy-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ziad-aladawy-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ziad-aladawy-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ziad-aladawy-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ziad-aladawy-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ziad-aladawy-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/7fc9bb2724a33b26267e63808a1da9637063c93c","node_id":"C_kwDOSUM_ZtoAKDdmYzliYjI3MjRhMzNiMjYyNjdlNjM4MDhhMWRhOTYzNzA2M2M5M2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/80b29db9ed59ca1bfc596e229f675ae58e12304c","sha":"80b29db9ed59ca1bfc596e229f675ae58e12304c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/80b29db9ed59ca1bfc596e229f675ae58e12304c"}],"sha":"7fc9bb2724a33b26267e63808a1da9637063c93c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/7fc9bb2724a33b26267e63808a1da9637063c93c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/5a14424c94caba212475c6e308482952ddd02968/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T19:02:36Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T19:03:16Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"Fix outbox/sync concurrency races and exception message leak\n\nC1: OutboxDispatcher now claims a batch via an atomic lease\n(LockedBy/LockedUntil stamped with ExecuteUpdateAsync, then reads back\nonly rows carrying this instance token) so horizontally-scaled\ndispatchers cannot double-process. InMemory test path keeps direct load.\n\nC2: CoreWriteGateway.UpsertAsync retries once on a unique-violation\nDbUpdateException (clear tracker + re-read) so a concurrent identical\ninsert no longer crashes the whole sync batch.\n\nE1: OutboxPoisonQueue.RequeueAsync resets poison flags via a guarded\nExecuteUpdateAsync (WHERE ProcessedAt IS NULL) so it cannot clobber a\nrow the dispatcher processed in the read-then-write window.\n\nE2: GlobalExceptionHandler only surfaces a literal exception.Message\nwhen the exception derives from AppException; arbitrary/third-party\nexceptions fall back to the generic localized string, preventing leakage\nof connection strings/paths/stack detail to clients.\n\nAdds migration AddOutboxLease (two nullable columns on OutboxMessages).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bdd27a1690dfa9ceffb83e9839f9a1fc1de6b7d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/bdd27a1690dfa9ceffb83e9839f9a1fc1de6b7d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/5a14424c94caba212475c6e308482952ddd02968","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/5a14424c94caba212475c6e308482952ddd02968","node_id":"C_kwDOSUM_ZtoAKDVhMTQ0MjRjOTRjYWJhMjEyNDc1YzZlMzA4NDgyOTUyZGRkMDI5Njg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/049c9bef745dd26187c828b62b38359bb8a42294","sha":"049c9bef745dd26187c828b62b38359bb8a42294","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/049c9bef745dd26187c828b62b38359bb8a42294"}],"sha":"5a14424c94caba212475c6e308482952ddd02968","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/5a14424c94caba212475c6e308482952ddd02968"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/049c9bef745dd26187c828b62b38359bb8a42294/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T17:50:01Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T17:50:01Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"feat: add academic records and sync dead-lettering\n\nSilently dropping unresolved sync dependencies causes permanent data\nloss upon cursor advancement. Dead-letter missing courses and students\nto sync.failures for visibility and admin replay.\n\nIntroduce Academic Records module for transcript and grades queries.\nRemove obsolete architecture documentation.\nFix registration recurring job to be pull-only.","tree":{"sha":"256c5d5facbb94093f4e984b77a83b522134c1ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/256c5d5facbb94093f4e984b77a83b522134c1ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladaw