om/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/aed61a6e103ee85d2bb1669e8dd1683bf53054c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T13:59:05Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T13:59:05Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"Address external review: E1, H1, C2, E2\n\n- E1: map Treasury expired/timeout -> SettlementOutcome.Expired so reconciliation\n  releases fees immediately instead of waiting for the Portal TTL.\n- H1: defensive status parsing (eFinance can return data:\"\" ); non-object data is\n  treated as not-yet-resolved (Pending), never an exception.\n- C2: IOutbox is now mandatory in SettlementService; wire the outbox stack\n  (IOutbox + IExecutionContext + ICurrentCultureService) into the reconciliation\n  host via AddTreasuryReconciliation so polling-driven settlements publish\n  FeePaidEvent (no more stuck WaitingPayment requests).\n- E2: robust billing name split (single/compound names always populate first+last).\n\nA1 (studentReferenceId = NationalId) kept per decision; A2 (receiptId cap) not\napplied per decision. Build green; tests Core 1007, Sync 181, Contract 34.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"018a61e5663cc373e1a6cebc46e2a0c3e6b04509","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/018a61e5663cc373e1a6cebc46e2a0c3e6b04509"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/aed61a6e103ee85d2bb1669e8dd1683bf53054c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/aed61a6e103ee85d2bb1669e8dd1683bf53054c5","node_id":"C_kwDOSUM_ZtoAKGFlZDYxYTZlMTAzZWU4NWQyYmIxNjY5ZThkZDE2ODNiZjUzMDU0YzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/e258ad7faf0e7368fe2982c40a3c08c6333d11a8","sha":"e258ad7faf0e7368fe2982c40a3c08c6333d11a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/e258ad7faf0e7368fe2982c40a3c08c6333d11a8"}],"sha":"aed61a6e103ee85d2bb1669e8dd1683bf53054c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/aed61a6e103ee85d2bb1669e8dd1683bf53054c5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/e258ad7faf0e7368fe2982c40a3c08c6333d11a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T12:04:30Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T12:04:30Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"Fix D8: reconciliation liveness (grace window, per-run cap, attempt escalation)\n\n- Skip orders younger than ReconciliationGraceMinutes (avoid racing live payments).\n- Cap orders examined per run (ReconciliationBatchSize).\n- Track consecutive failed status checks on Order.ReconciliationAttempts; reset on\n  a successful check; escalate to an ops alert (LogError) at ReconciliationMaxAttempts.\n- Migration AddOrderReconciliationAttempts (additive).\n\nBuild green. Tests: Core 1007, Sync 181.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb3c33894700f19f0bf19805bd08f004356488e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/cb3c33894700f19f0bf19805bd08f004356488e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/e258ad7faf0e7368fe2982c40a3c08c6333d11a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/e258ad7faf0e7368fe2982c40a3c08c6333d11a8","node_id":"C_kwDOSUM_ZtoAKGUyNThhZDdmYWYwZTczNjhmZTI5ODJjNDBhM2MwOGM2MzMzZDExYTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/dbca26d404d35485321c87f435ca43c79eaafd4c","sha":"dbca26d404d35485321c87f435ca43c79eaafd4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/dbca26d404d35485321c87f435ca43c79eaafd4c"}],"sha":"e258ad7faf0e7368fe2982c40a3c08c6333d11a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/e258ad7faf0e7368fe2982c40a3c08c6333d11a8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/dbca26d404d35485321c87f435ca43c79eaafd4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T11:45:49Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T11:45:49Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"Realign Treasury integration to the documented contract (+ D4/D7/D9)\n\nRebuild the Treasury client and DTOs to match Treasury_Sys_APIs.md:\n- Receipts: send required connectionTypeIds query; unwrap BaseResponse; receipt\n  ids are integers.\n- Initiate: per-gateway wire request/response. BM/eFinance send required\n  billingDetails (sourced from the student profile); BM has no merchantOrderId so\n  bmmId is used as the key; eFinance/Mastercard use their merchantOrderId. Field\n  names per gateway (merchantRedirectUrl vs redirectUrl, paymentMechanism).\n- Quantity: receiptIds expanded per fee quantity (repeat id N times).\n- Status: unwrap BaseResponse; normalized {status, amount, currency}.\n- Webhook: nested transaction payload; header X-Webhook-Signature.\n- Route casing: efinance (lowercase) for initiate + status.\n\nAudit fixes folded in:\n- D4: persist an initiation intent (audit row) before the gateway call.\n- D7: fail initiation if any receipt id cannot be resolved.\n- D9: verify reported paid amount against order total; block + alert on mismatch.\n- D6: status-token mapping confirmed sufficient (PAID/PENDING map via lowercase).\n\nBuild green. Tests: Core 1007, Sync 181, Contract 34, Architecture 1.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"14e5e8d99bdb573bc022b91aabaa6166c507481f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/14e5e8d99bdb573bc022b91aabaa6166c507481f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/dbca26d404d35485321c87f435ca43c79eaafd4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/dbca26d404d35485321c87f435ca43c79eaafd4c","node_id":"C_kwDOSUM_ZtoAKGRiY2EyNmQ0MDRkMzU0ODUzMjFjODdmNDM1Y2E0M2M3OWVhYWZkNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/d17f58ccfd95c79e1279abab972a2cbe8b56247f","sha":"d17f58ccfd95c79e1279abab972a2cbe8b56247f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/d17f58ccfd95c79e1279abab972a2cbe8b56247f"}],"sha":"dbca26d404d35485321c87f435ca43c79eaafd4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/dbca26d404d35485321c87f435ca43c79eaafd4c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/d17f58ccfd95c79e1279abab972a2cbe8b56247f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T11:19:46Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T11:19:46Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"Revert D3 (was based on a wrong premise)\n\nThe Treasury contract (Treasury_Sys_APIs.md) shows initiate takes no amount and\nTreasury prices from receiptIds (eFinance returns base/collection/total). The\nprior D3 fix computed the breakdown locally and sent an Amount that no endpoint\naccepts. Reverting Order.BaseAmount/CollectionFees/ItemCount + the\nAddOrderAmountBreakdown migration; Order.TotalAmount returns to sum of fees.\nD5 (re-open & settle) retained.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"06d511f56e3f97921921c2a7b0ea899778e88d90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/06d511f56e3f97921921c2a7b0ea899778e88d90"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/d17f58ccfd95c79e1279abab972a2cbe8b56247f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/d17f58ccfd95c79e1279abab972a2cbe8b56247f","node_id":"C_kwDOSUM_ZtoAKGQxN2Y1OGNjZmQ5NWM3OWUxMjc5YWJhYjk3MmEyY2JlOGI1NjI0N2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/003be4f5a98eec508c3851451fe33a5554e3f2a8","sha":"003be4f5a98eec508c3851451fe33a5554e3f2a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/003be4f5a98eec508c3851451fe33a5554e3f2a8"}],"sha":"d17f58ccfd95c79e1279abab972a2cbe8b56247f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/d17f58ccfd95c79e1279abab972a2cbe8b56247f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/003be4f5a98eec508c3851451fe33a5554e3f2a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T10:57:37Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T10:57:37Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"Fix D3 + D5 per decisions\n\nD3 (Treasury charges TotalAmount; add internal breakdown): add Order.BaseAmount,\nCollectionFees (default 0), ItemCount; TotalAmount = BaseAmount + CollectionFees.\nPopulated at order creation; exposed on OrderResponse. Migration\nAddOrderAmountBreakdown (additive). Initiation still sends Amount = TotalAmount.\n\nD5 (re-open & settle on late Paid): Paid now settles orders in PendingPayment,\nFailed, or Expired state. Release (Failed/Expired) keeps fee.OrderId so the order\ncan be re-opened; settlement only pays fees still attached to the order and skips\nany already paid (unique Payment.FeeId backstop). Already Paid/Cancelled/Refunded\nremain idempotent no-ops.\n\nBuild green. Tests: Core 1007, Sync 181, Contract 34.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"92780575eb0e5a79966aecd98f21ac73ae5efbd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/92780575eb0e5a79966aecd98f21ac73ae5efbd7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/003be4f5a98eec508c3851451fe33a5554e3f2a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"