"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/1ccb5d2e029136c1c9e1e880d3e8175b81868019/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T05:11:59Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T05:11:59Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"Fix F7: handle concurrency in settlement\n\nCatch DbUpdateConcurrencyException (RowVersion) in addition to unique-index\nviolations during settlement: clear the change tracker and treat as an\nidempotent no-op. A concurrent webhook + reconciliation settling the same order\nno longer returns 500 / poisons the Hangfire job, and never creates duplicate\npayments.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"491b635e92c45bb9c4ac5764d84b522285a46747","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/491b635e92c45bb9c4ac5764d84b522285a46747"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/1ccb5d2e029136c1c9e1e880d3e8175b81868019","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28