m/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/a19e326135d7176fa565734d51942f4046b39899/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T05:10:06Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T05:10:06Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"Fix F3: wire outbox into reconciliation host\n\nAdd AddOutboxForBackgroundHost (registers IExecutionContext,\nICurrentCultureService, IOutbox) and call it + AddHttpContextAccessor in\nSync.Host. Reconciliation-driven settlements now stage FeePaidEvent on the\nshared CoreDbContext, drained by the API host''s OutboxDispatcher — so missed-\nwebhook orders advance student requests identically to the webhook path.\nIdempotency preserved (settlement enqueues only on the PendingPayment->Paid\nedge; duplicate outcomes are no-ops).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b76a8052a93e2513a76e918e9be2dd58512b70c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/b76a8052a93e2513a76e918e9be2dd58512b70c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/a19e326135d7176fa565734d51942f4046b39899","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/a19e326135d7176fa565734d51942f4046b39899","node_id":"C_kwDOSUM_ZtoAKGExOWUzMjYxMzVkNzE3NmZhNTY1NzM0ZDUxOTQyZjQwNDZiMzk4OTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/aabedbab9b5b76d4b4238722aede4d703d7eabe6","sha":"aabedbab9b5b76d4b4238722aede4d703d7eabe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/aabedbab9b5b76d4b4238722aede4d703d7eabe6"}],"sha":"a19e326135d7176fa565734d51942f4046b39899","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/a19e326135d7176fa565734d51942f4046b39899"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/aabedbab9b5b76d4b4238722aede4d703d7eabe6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T05:07:27Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T05:07:27Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"Fix F2: settle Paid only from PendingPayment\n\nGuard Paid settlement on order.Status == PendingPayment. Paid notifications for\norders in any other state (Paid/Failed/Expired/Cancelled/Refunded) are logged\nand ignored as idempotent no-ops, so late/replayed webhooks can no longer pay\nreleased or re-ordered fees.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c10b9a80757f57fb92d00380799c036dfd4edf4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/9c10b9a80757f57fb92d00380799c036dfd4edf4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/aabedbab9b5b76d4b4238722aede4d703d7eabe6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/aabedbab9b5b76d4b4238722aede4d703d7eabe6","node_id":"C_kwDOSUM_ZtoAKGFhYmVkYmFiOWI1Yjc2ZDRiNDIzODcyMmFlZGU0ZDcwM2Q3ZWFiZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/678574e9c54adfca72f8e15f0be07d4ab97ac5e7","sha":"678574e9c54adfca72f8e15f0be07d4ab97ac5e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/678574e9c54adfca72f8e15f0be07d4ab97ac5e7"}],"sha":"aabedbab9b5b76d4b4238722aede4d703d7eabe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/aabedbab9b5b76d4b4238722aede4d703d7eabe6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/678574e9c54adfca72f8e15f0be07d4ab97ac5e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T05:05:14Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T05:05:14Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"Fix F1: webhook fails closed when no secret configured\n\nReject Treasury webhooks (401) outside Development when Treasury:WebhookSecret\nis empty, and log every rejection. Previously an empty secret bypassed\nverification entirely, leaving an anonymous settlement trigger.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b653000637d40eb20d66a58ece3d18720718074","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/0b653000637d40eb20d66a58ece3d18720718074"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/678574e9c54adfca72f8e15f0be07d4ab97ac5e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/678574e9c54adfca72f8e15f0be07d4ab97ac5e7","node_id":"C_kwDOSUM_ZtoAKDY3ODU3NGU5YzU0YWRmY2E3MmY4ZTE1ZjBiZTA3ZDRhYjk3YWM1ZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/dbb8a6571fef05e139744495137126a5a594db24","sha":"dbb8a6571fef05e139744495137126a5a594db24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/dbb8a6571fef05e139744495137126a5a594db24"}],"sha":"678574e9c54adfca72f8e15f0be07d4ab97ac5e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/678574e9c54adfca72f8e15f0be07d4ab97ac5e7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/dbb8a6571fef05e139744495137126a5a594db24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T04:35:40Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T04:35:40Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"Phase 7: Settlement & reconciliation (additive)\n\nIdempotent settlement shared by webhook + reconciliation: resolve order by\nMerchantOrderId, create one Payment per fee (unique FeeId guards duplicates),\nmark fees/order Paid, publish FeePaidEvent per fee; Failed/Expired releases\nfees. Status polling + Hangfire reconciliation job (Sync.Host) backstop missed\nwebhooks. StudentServices consumes payments.fee.paid to advance requests.\n\n- Abstractions: ISettlementService, IReconciliationService, SettlementOutcome,\n  FeePaidEvent/Fact, TreasuryStatus/Webhook DTOs, ITreasuryClient.GetStatusAsync,\n  TreasuryOptions ReconciliationCron + WebhookSecret.\n- Module: SettlementService (CoreDbContext save, optional IOutbox, unique-violation\n  guard), ReconciliationService, TreasuryStatusMapper, TreasuryClient.GetStatusAsync;\n  AddTreasuryReconciliation extension; DI regs.\n- API: PaymentsWebhookController (POST /api/payments/webhook, shared-secret).\n- StudentServices: FeePaidEventHandler (+registration).\n- Sync.Host: TreasuryReconciliationTrigger + wiring + \"treasury-reconciliation\" job.\n\nNo existing entities/APIs/tables/migrations removed. Refunds/legacy cleanup NOT\nimplemented (stop after Phase 7).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"86614c8309a040279021ab9e26926f3856ce4272","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/86614c8309a040279021ab9e26926f3856ce4272"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/dbb8a6571fef05e139744495137126a5a594db24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/