rviceReceiptMapping DTOs; +SubmitStudentServiceRequestRequest.Quantity.\n- Module: FeeGenerationService, ServiceReceiptMappingService; DI registrations.\n- API: ServiceReceiptMappingsController (CRUD).\n- StudentServices: inject IFeeGenerationService, additive submit integration.\n- Tests: add IFeeGenerationService mock (returns null -> legacy path). 47 pass.\n\nNo existing entities/APIs/tables/migrations removed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"543e6cc7b1ffaa112ddf41d5c38bc825ca45b150","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/543e6cc7b1ffaa112ddf41d5c38bc825ca45b150"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/3eaa4484dff29917f0a0bbe24745deeb1e8fcd78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commit/3eaa4484dff29917f0a0bbe24745deeb1e8fcd78","node_id":"C_kwDOSUM_ZtoA