reWriteGateway (external-wins). Recurring Hangfire job registered in\nSync.Host (where the Hangfire server runs).\n\n- Module: IReceiptSyncService + ReceiptSyncService (DTO->TreasuryReceipt map,\n  gateway upsert); AddTreasuryReceiptSync DI extension; ReceiptPullCron option.\n- Sync.Host: TreasuryReceiptPullTrigger; wire AddTreasuryIntegration +\n  AddTreasuryReceiptSync; register \"treasury-receipt-pull\" recurring job;\n  Treasury config section.\n\nNo existing sync modules, entities, APIs, tables, or migrations touched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"31ebaa8abe2673db8bf03eba7df7f99e08526219","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/31ebaa8abe2673db8bf03eba7df7f99e08526219"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/3003458bac32749e22fa593af109f67b54f58766","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://git