egration layer (additive)\n\nAdd outbound Treasury client + options + DTOs + gateway route map, and wire\nGET /api/payments/receipts (ConnectionTypeId=6 filter). Typed HttpClient with\nstandard resilience handler; reusable AddTreasuryIntegration extension.\n\n- Abstractions: ITreasuryClient, TreasuryReceiptDto, TreasuryOptions,\n  TreasuryGatewayRoutes.\n- Module: TreasuryClient impl, AddTreasuryIntegration DI extension; +Microsoft\n  .Extensions.Http(.Resilience) package refs.\n- API: wire AddTreasuryIntegration; new additive TreasuryController GET receipts;\n  Treasury config section in appsettings.json.\n\nNo existing entities/APIs/tables/migrations touched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"36d1ca8d146b895de792e430b4a013f6aa42389e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/36d1ca8d146b895de792e430b4a013f6aa42389e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/d6bd6ce884fb34c1aaa3b60f2e889d1786756e0d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M