d":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/41d7b242ad7f7019d2bb80746537dced8484a301/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T21:48:57Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T21:48:57Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"feat(auth): per-action permission overrides, scoped grants, manifest-driven roles\n\nPrimary work is the permissions/authorization overhaul; this commit also\ncheckpoints the sync_platform_hardening branch''s in-progress changes across the\nother modules (whole tree builds and every test suite is green).\n\nPermissions & roles:\n- PermissionOverrideModel: drop the legacy ActionLevel ladder; Actions (canonical\n  per-action names) is the only shape. Writes expand through the manifest implies\n  graph (Allow=forward closure, Deny=reverse closure).\n- Per-override scope: an override may carry its own structural/temporal scope,\n  inheriting the request (role) scope when omitted, so one assignment can place a\n  role at one scope and an individual permission at another.\n- GetAssignment reshaped to surface overrides from every scope, each tagged with\n  its own scope.\n- ExpiresAt: stamp the temporal-scope end on override rows; manual ExpireOverrides\n  sweep + BackfillOverrideExpiry; read-time filtering excludes expired overrides.\n- Role-permission management API: SetRolePermissions (full-replace, manifest\n  expanded) + PUT /api/authorization/roles/{id}/permissions.\n- Admin nav resources (dashboard/users/structure/programs/sync) are now\n  manifest-backed; the seeder routes grants through the manifest with no CRUD-ladder\n  fallback. ActionLevel enum fully retired.\n- Removed dead code: HasResource, ExpandToCanonical, WithCrudActionsNoOpen.\n\nFixes:\n- Mongo audit logging: register ObjectSerializer + GuidSerializer with Standard\n  GuidRepresentation so audit metadata containing Guids serializes instead of being\n  dropped by AuditLogFlushWorker (MongoDB.Driver 3.x has no default representation).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fe4aaf7763bc6ca4cb1312288c635d931137bfae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/fe4aaf7763bc6ca4cb1312288c635d931137bfae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/41d7b242ad7f7019d2bb80746537dced8484a301","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"http