url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/commits/11aaf0b5a08773f065ee60753323b78b03d18850/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T18:07:14Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T18:07:14Z","email":"menna11hassanien@gmail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"fix(migrations): neutralise duplicate r2 migration\n\nThe 20260518154708_r2 migration was a full duplicate of two earlier ones:\n  - AddColumn<int>(\"SessionVersion\", ...) for Students + Staffs was\n    already done by AddSessionVersion (20260517000001).\n  - CreateTable(\"OutboxMessages\") was already done by AddOutboxMessages\n    (20260517000002).\n\nOn a fresh database, dotnet ef database update raised:\n  \"Column name ''SessionVersion'' in table ''Students'' is specified more\n   than once.\" / \"There is already an object named ''OutboxMessages''.\"\n\nDevs whose __EFMigrationsHistory already contained r2 had survived only\nby skipping r2 manually or running against InMemory; the chain was\nunrunnable end-to-end from a clean DB.\n\nFix: keep the migration class but make Up/Down intentional no-ops.\nDeleting the file outright would break installations that already have\nr2 in their migration history (EF refuses to start when a logged\nmigration has no matching type in the assembly). The empty Up/Down do\nnothing on a future re-apply; the canonical column/table state is owned\nby AddSessionVersion + AddOutboxMessages.\n\nVerified: dotnet ef migrations script on the full chain now emits exactly\none ALTER TABLE [Students] ADD [SessionVersion] and one\nCREATE TABLE [OutboxMessages].\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c24fe7862c15e0cc3bafbd9d181d1c21feab5a02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/c24fe7862c15e0cc3bafbd9d181d1c21feab5a02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/11aaf0b5a08773f065ee60753323b78b03d18850","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MennaMagdy28","id":132995770,"login":"MennaMagdy28","node_id":"U_kgDOB-1aug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/M