ail.com","name":"Menna Magdy"},"message":"refactor: route bulk + paging validation through localized exceptions\n\nReplaces hardcoded English BadRequest messages across the Phase 1 bulk\nendpoints and Phase 2 sort parser with the project''s standard validation\npipeline (ValidationException -> GlobalExceptionHandler -> localized\nProblemDetails with the errors dictionary).\n\nChanges\n- Add LocalizedKeys.BulkActions.* and LocalizedKeys.Paging.* with ar/en\n  strings in LocalizedStrings.\n- SortClause.Parse now throws with LocalizedKeys.Paging keys instead of\n  literal English; field/direction values stay in trace logs.\n- New BulkRequestGuard helper centralises the \"ids non-empty under cap\",\n  \"payload required\", \"reason required\", and \"records non-empty\" checks.\n- Refactor every bulk endpoint I touched in this session\n  (Notifications / CourseOfferings / Invoices / Permissions /\n  StudentServiceRequests / AcademicPlans / Courses / ScheduleSlots) to\n  call the guard instead of inline BadRequest objects.\n\nStudent/Staff/UniversityStructure controllers and AuthController are\ndeliberately untouched per scope.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8586efc326793ec7304b2fc1a1bd354ed5b668d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/trees/8586efc326793ec7304b2fc1a1bd354ed5b668d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ziad-aladawy-dev/capu-portal/git/commits/f57ab161e66cef0a37f4c51382f75f6361d7932f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132995770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MennaMagdy28/gists{/gist_id}","grava