ct)\n\nAdds .github/workflows/codeql.yml running github/codeql-action with\nupload:never (since this private repo lacks GitHub Advanced Security\nand would 403 on Security-tab upload). SARIF lands in workflow\nartifacts instead, mirroring the Semgrep pattern.\n\nMatrix runs python and javascript-typescript analyses in parallel\nusing the security-extended query pack. Triggers on push to main,\nevery PR, and manual dispatch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6434269e1f9eaffce37c59451f2d082d4afc6f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harpoonsecurity/pq-share/git/trees/a6434269e1f9eaffce37c59451f2d082d4afc6f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harpoonsecurity/pq-share/git/commits/e0a14674ec23db02e2384691b275eaab1ff79f76","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61232763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/harpoonsecurity","id":61232763,"login":"harpoonsecurity","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMjMyNzYz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/harpoonsecurity/pq-share/commit/e0a14674ec23db