"ci: emit SARIF alongside JSON for ACDI consumers\n\nAdds --sarif-output to the same Semgrep invocation so a single\nscan produces both vendor JSON and OASIS-standard SARIF. Both\nfiles upload as separate workflow artifacts (JSON for tools that\nspecifically speak Semgrep; SARIF for portable consumption by\nACDI/SAST aggregators).\n\nRenamed the existing JSON artifact to semgrep-results-json for\nsymmetry with the new semgrep-results-sarif.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d3488705ec29918007be500d53ce19024b3fd728","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harpoonsecurity/pq-share/git/trees/d3488705ec29918007be500d53ce19024b3fd728"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harpoonsecurity/pq-share/git/commits/7d9242b30e0e891f3008b290edeb2ef8f8141838","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61232763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/harpoonsecurity","id":61232763,"login":"harpoonsecurity","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMjMyNzYz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/harpoonsecurity/pq-share/comm