rity"},"message":"ci: emit Semgrep JSON output and upload as workflow artifact\n\nAdds --json-output flag so Semgrep writes findings to\nsemgrep-results.json while keeping the human-readable summary\nin the workflow log. Uploads the JSON as a ''semgrep-results''\nartifact (90-day retention) so downstream tooling can ingest it.\n\nStep uses if: always() so the artifact uploads even when Semgrep\nexits non-zero on blocking findings.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ecb71c5190b49ad540fccfba8e876c1ef0258f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harpoonsecurity/pq-share/git/trees/0ecb71c5190b49ad540fccfba8e876c1ef0258f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harpoonsecurity/pq-share/git/commits/f84bc75051ba84caaad5f58c426feacd4f3f85d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61232763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/harpoonsecurity","id":61232763,"login":"harpoonsecurity","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMjMyNzYz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/harpoonsecurity","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/harpoonsecurity/pq-share/commit/f84bc75