lth/commits/06271493d357e8c4e5f7447e64436d52c220492c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T21:06:22Z","email":"kolioane@gmail.com","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T21:06:22Z","email":"kolioane@gmail.com","name":"Kevin"},"message":"chore(dx): Makefile, updated CI workflows, and docs refresh\n\n## Makefile\n- Full local dev setup: install, db-up/down, dev, dev-civic, dev-health\n- Individual services: dev-shell (:4200), dev-lgu (:4201), dev-clinical (:4202),\n  dev-bff (:4300), storybook (:6006)\n- Database: migrate, migrate-civic, migrate-health, migrate-rollback, migrate-status\n- Build, test, lint, lint-fix, clean targets\n- Parallel full-stack via tmux (make dev / dev-civic / dev-health)\n\n## CI Workflows (multi-phase changes)\n- deploy-frontend-swa.yml: split build/deploy jobs, dorny/paths-filter for\n  selective builds, separate lgu-civic npm ci (Leaflet), Storybook artifact\n- deploy-health-aks.yml: path corrected ruby-bff→ha-bff, RSpec test gate,\n  PWA ngsw build note, ActiveRecord migration-before-deploy kubectl Job,\n  dual :sha/:latest image tags\n- deploy-civic-api.yml: split test/deploy jobs, EF Core migration-before-deploy\n  with dotnet-ef global tool, Release config throughout\n\n## Docs\n- README.md: prerequisites table, make-based quick start, common commands\n  table, debugging quick reference (ports, MFE, SQL Server, PWA, JWT)\n- TROUBLESHOOTING.md: rewritten — 13 issues across MFE, auth/identity,\n  database, PWA/SW, Storybook, CI/CD; all with symptom/cause/debug/fix\n- DEPLOYMENT.md: infrastructure table, required secrets per workflow,\n  phase change notes per pipeline, deployment debugging section\n\nCo-Authored-By: AdaL <adal@sylph.ai>","tree":{"sha":"136fb9a3254d677904380db0be6e709ac11481b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kekcoke/civichealth/git/trees/136fb9a3254d677904380db0be6e709ac11481b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kekcoke/civichealth/git/commits/06271493d357e8c4e5f7447e64436d52