008d2de671617","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kekcoke/civichealth/commits/f8cc74fac59781a79b6a9017ae1008d2de671617"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25495857?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kekcoke","id":25495857,"login":"kekcoke","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NDk1ODU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kekcoke/civichealth/commits/cb88cc36e35f824006a1eb314a8eacf7b7fbb551/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T20:19:59Z","email":"kolioane@gmail.com","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T20:19:59Z","email":"kolioane@gmail.com","name":"Kevin"},"message":"feat(phase-2): Civic API REST controllers + HA BFF GraphQL schema\n\nCivic API (.NET 10 REST controllers):\n- CitizensController: GET/POST/PUT citizen, GET/POST bank-accounts\n- InvoicesController: GET (filterable by status), POST, PUT\n- PaymentsController: GET, POST (double-billing guard), POST refund\n- PermitsController: GET (filterable), POST\n- ServiceRequestsController: GET, POST, PUT (with audit log), DELETE\n- PropertiesController: GET property, GET assessments\n- NotificationsController: GET (filterable by citizenId)\n- InsurancePoliciesController: GET active policies\n\nHA BFF (Ruby GraphQL schema):\n- 9 ActiveRecord models: Patient, Provider, Appointment, Encounter,\n  MedicalRecord, Prescription, Claim, ConsentDirective, Facility\n- 6 GraphQL types: PatientType, ProviderType, AppointmentType,\n  EncounterType, PrescriptionType, ClaimType\n- QueryType: 7 queries (getPatientRecord w/ PHI guard, listAppointments,\n  searchProviders, listEncounters, getLabResults, getActivePrescriptions,\n  getClinicalBalances, checkClaimStatus)\n- 8 Mutations: OnboardPatient, UpdatePatient, UpdateConsent,\n  ScheduleAppointment, CancelAppointment, CreateEncounter,\n  CreateLabOrder, SubmitClaim\n- Schema: HaBff::Schema with Dataloader, max_depth 10, JWT context\n- app.rb: Sinatra app with JWT guard, CORS, /api/ha/v1/graphql endpoint\n\nCo-Authored-By: AdaL <adal@sylph.ai>","tree":{"sha":"48f874f8263e233e99a0a5b07cb26e5c0449dd23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kekcoke/civichealth/git/trees/48f874f8263e233e99a0a5b07cb26e5c0449dd23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kekcoke/civichealth/git/commits/cb88cc36e35f824006a1eb314a8eacf7b7fbb551","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25495857?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kekcoke","id":25495857,"login":"kekcoke","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NDk1ODU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/subscr