ll Phase 1 additions: 13 EF Core entity models, AppDbContext\n  index strategy, InitialCivicSchema migration, HA BFF 15 ActiveRecord\n  migrations, Columnstore indexes, and Temporal Tables\n- Documents Pre-Phase 1 project bootstrap artifacts\n- Marks Phase 2 (Civic Enablement) as Unreleased/Planned\n\nCo-Authored-By: AdaL <adal@sylph.ai>","tree":{"sha":"22cdaf70a7f19c31e85319f141609d3bd4500046","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kekcoke/civichealth/git/trees/22cdaf70a7f19c31e85319f141609d3bd4500046"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kekcoke/civichealth/git/commits/992b531812329fa4adf97d5f991ba57e598994fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25495857?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kekcoke","id":25495857,"login":"kekcoke","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NDk1ODU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kekcoke/civichealth/commit/992b531812329fa4adf97d5f991ba57e598994fc","node_id":"C_kwDOSUYN0toAKDk5MmI1MzE4MTIzMjlmYTRhZGY5N2Q1Zjk5MWJhNTdlNTk4OTk0ZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kekcoke/civichealth/commit/f17da63defa6bccec0a392bbdcbfeb82cbf99d65","sha":"f17da63defa6bccec0a392bbdcbfeb82cbf99d65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kekcoke/civichealth/commits/f17da63defa6bccec0a392bbdcbfeb82cbf99d65"}],"sha":"992b531812329fa4adf97d5f991ba57e598994fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kekcoke/civichealth/commits/992b531812329fa4adf97d5f991ba57e598994fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25495857?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kekcoke","id":25495857,"login":"kekcoke","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NDk1ODU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kekcoke/civichealth/commits/f17da63defa6bccec0a392bbdcbfeb82cbf99d65/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T20:12:46Z","email":"kolioane@gmail.com","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T20:12:46Z","email":"kolioane@gmail.com","name":"Kevin"},"message":"feat(phase-1): scaffold civic-api and ha-bff with database migrations\n\nCivic API (.NET 10 + EF Core + PostgreSQL/PostGIS):\n- 13 entity models: Citizens, BankAccounts, Invoices, Payments,\n  PaymentBatches, Properties, TaxAssessments, Permits, ServiceRequests,\n  ServiceRequestLogs, Notifications, InsurancePolicies, Departments\n- AppDbContext with all indexes: B-Tree, composite, partial (OVERDUE),\n  BRIN (time-series), GiST (PostGIS geometry), GIN (JSONB)\n- InitialCivicSchema EF migration generated and verified (build clean)\n- Program.cs wired with Npgsql + NetTopologySuite + connection strings\n\nHA BFF (Ruby + ActiveRecord + SQL Server):\n- 15 migrations: patients, providers, facilities, provider_schedules,\n  appointments, medical_records, encounters, diagnostics, formulary,\n  prescriptions, consent_directives, clinical_accounts, claims\n- Columnstore indexes (medical_records, diagnostics) via raw SQL migration\n- Temporal Tables on prescriptions for regulatory audit history\n- Gemfile, Rakefile (standalone_migrations), database.yml, initializer\n\nCo-Authored-By: AdaL <adal@sylph.ai>","tree":{"sha":"1a2bfb767532ab9b5c4d4822f6a77dcf797b9cc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kekcoke/civichealth/git/trees/1a2bfb767532ab9b5c4d4822f6a77dcf797b9cc6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kekcoke/civichealth/git/commits/f17da63defa6bccec0a392bbdcbfeb82cbf99d65","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25495857?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kekcoke","id":25495857,"login":"kekcoke","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NDk1ODU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kekcoke","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kekcoke/