"login":"VeNoMZiTo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjI5Njg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits/eaa6c93c4c5244e82c683119905771991d0a472f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T17:17:21Z","email":"venomzito@gmail.com","name":"Adrián Ramos Medina"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T17:17:21Z","email":"venomzito@gmail.com","name":"Adrián Ramos Medina"},"message":"docs(tei-ui): example/ con showcase Next.js de los 14 primitivos v1.0.0\n\nPágina única de demo + README con instrucciones de smoke test. La\npágina compone los 14 primitivos en un layout realista (header con\nNotificationInbox, KPIs con Stat, filtros con Tag dismissible,\nformulario con Stepper/DateInput/NumberInput/FileDropzone, ficha con\nDescriptionList, actividad con Timeline, código con CodeTabs).\n\nSmoke test ya verificado contra Next 16 + React 19 + Tailwind 4 +\nshadcn 3:\n- 14 primitivos instalados sin errores\n- shadcn auto-resuelve deps internas (avatar, utils, tabs, button,\n  sheet, card)\n- tsc --noEmit: 0 errores en consumer\n- npm run build: producción OK, 1.7s compile + 357ms static gen\n\nexample/ no se publica al registry — vive en el repo como referencia\nvisual.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4214f9dbba657854f831ba014f904e4d11d2d38b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/git/trees/4214f9dbba657854f831ba014f904e4d11d2d38b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/git/commits/eaa6c93c4c5244