url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VeNoMZiTo","id":1822968,"login":"VeNoMZiTo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjI5Njg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits/cfb16484f55abb181a42c7486c842a3e33eb6141/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T16:47:31Z","email":"venomzito@gmail.com","name":"Adrián Ramos Medina"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T16:47:31Z","email":"venomzito@gmail.com","name":"Adrián Ramos Medina"},"message":"chore(tei-ui): release v1.0.0 — CHANGELOG, USAGE.md y tsconfig de check\n\nCierra la primera release estable del registry. Sin cambios en\ncomponentes — solo documentación, versionado y herramienta de\ntypecheck offline contra el node_modules del monorepo.\n\n- package.json: 0.1.0 → 1.0.0\n- CHANGELOG.md: historial completo desde el bootstrap (0.1.0 → 1.0.0)\n  con secciones Keep a Changelog para los cinco lotes ya publicados\n- USAGE.md: snippets mínimos de uso para los 14 primitivos nuevos\n  (avatar-group, banner, code-tabs, confirm-inline, date-input,\n  description-list, file-dropzone, notification-inbox, number-input,\n  rating, stat, stepper, tag, timeline) + nota sobre patterns y\n  primitivos shadcn standard\n- README.md: enlaces a USAGE.md y CHANGELOG.md\n- tsconfig.check.json: tsconfig dedicado al typecheck (paths @/*,\n  jsx preserve, typeRoots al ../node_modules) — `tsc -p tsconfig.check.json`\n  valida componentes contra los tipos de React/Radix instalados en el\n  monorepo. Verificación de los 14 nuevos: 0 errores.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1062397b7766c2416ed0a4264a88937e30b7c166","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/git/trees/1062397b7766c2416ed0a4264a88937e30b7c166"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/git/commits/cfb16484f55abb181a42c7486c842a3e33eb6141","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1822968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VeNoMZiTo","id":1822968,"login":"VeNoMZiTo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjI5Njg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commit/cfb16484f55abb181a42c7486c842a3e33eb6141","node_id":"C_kwDOSVJ1vdoAKGNmYjE2NDg0ZjU1YWJiMTgxYTQyYzc0ODZjODQyYTNlMzNlYjYxNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commit/f19dcf7965dcd51b709f191726526237ef93ee1d","sha":"f19dcf7965dcd51b709f191726526237ef93ee1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits/f19dcf7965dcd51b709f191726526237ef93ee1d"}],"sha":"cfb16484f55abb181a42c7486c842a3e33eb6141","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits/cfb16484f55abb181a42c7486c842a3e33eb6141"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1822968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VeNoMZiTo","id":1822968,"login":"VeNoMZiTo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjI5Njg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits/f19dcf7965dcd51b709f191726526237ef93ee1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T10:36:50Z","email":"venomzito@gmail.com","name":"Adrián Ramos Medina"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T10:36:50Z","email":"venomzito@gmail.com","name":"Adrián Ramos Medina"},"message":"feat(tei-ui): 14 nuevos primitivos portados de estilo-dimensiontei\n\nCierra el set de primitivos cubriendo todos los componentes Astro\nreutilizables del design system TEI que aún no tenían equivalente\nReact en el registry.\n\nNuevos:\n- avatar-group: pila de avatares con +N overflow\n- banner: aviso ancho con acción + cierre\n- code-tabs: tabs multi-lenguaje (astro/html/react/vue/blade) con copy y persistencia localStorage\n- confirm-inline: confirmación in-situ sin overlay\n- date-input: input date/time/month con icono leading\n- description-list: dl/dt/dd horizontal o vertical\n- file-dropzone: zona drag & drop con preview\n- notification-inbox: campana con contador + Sheet de notificaciones\n- number-input: stepper numérico con botones +/−\n- rating: estrellas display o interactivas\n- stat: tarjeta KPI con franja de acento, hint y delta semántico\n- stepper: indicador multi-paso horizontal o vertical\n- tag: badge dismissible para colecciones (filtros, tags)\n- timeline: feed cronológico vertical con icono y body\n\nTotal registry: 79 items (68 ui + 9 blocks + tokens + utils).\nBuild limpio, deps detectadas correctamente por build-registry.ts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5f0390b3d0f37ac930ab63ac47928e6e364e9435","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/git/trees/5f0390b3d0f37ac930ab63ac47928e6e364e9435"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/git/commits/f19dcf7965dcd51b709f191726526237ef93ee1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1822968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VeNoMZiTo","id":1822968,"login":"VeNoMZiTo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjI5Njg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commit/f19dcf7965dcd51b709f191726526237ef93ee1d","node_id":"C_kwDOSVJ1vdoAKGYxOWRjZjc5NjVkY2Q1MWI3MDlmMTkxNzI2NTI2MjM3ZWY5M2VlMWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commit/749e5f8b8a42563ac05b1cf4dc777f57bcb18e2a","sha":"749e5f8b8a42563ac05b1cf4dc777f57bcb18e2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits/749e5f8b8a42563ac05b1cf4dc777f57bcb18e2a"}],"sha":"f19dcf7965dcd51b709f191726526237ef93ee1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits/f19dcf7965dcd51b709f191726526237ef93ee1d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1822968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VeNoMZiTo","id":1822968,"login":"VeNoMZiTo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjI5Njg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits/749e5f8b8a42563ac05b1cf4dc777f57bcb18e2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T21:35:45Z","email":"venomzito@gmail.com","name":"Adrián Ramos Medina"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T21:35:45Z","email":"venomzito@gmail.com","name":"Adrián Ramos Medina"},"message":"feat(tei-ui): 9 patrones de pagina completos como bloques registry\n\nPlantillas tomadas del design system estilo-dimensiontei (carpeta\nsrc/pages/patrones) y portadas a React/Next con los primitivos del\nregistry. Cada bloque es una pagina entera lista para copiar y editar.\n\n- pattern-login: tarjeta centrada, iconos leading, toggle contrasena\n- pattern-error: 404/403/500/mantenimiento con presets + custom\n- pattern-empty-states: lista vacia, sin resultados, carpeta, offline,\n  error de carga + galeria\n- pattern-two-column: layout settings con sub-nav lateral\n- pattern-master-detail: lista + detalle, colapsable en movil\n- pattern-settings: header + tabs + SettingsSection + SettingsRow\n  + zona peligrosa con borde --tei-danger\n- pattern-dashboard: shell con header/kpis/filtros/contenido/footer\n  + StatCard con delta y tono semantico\n- pattern-table: tabla densa con sort cliente, busqueda, filtros como\n  badges eliminables, seleccion multiple con bulk actions, paginacion\n- pattern-long-form: stepper + body + footer sticky con back/save/next\n\nbuild-registry.ts ahora indexa src/components/blocks/ y emite items\nde tipo registry:block. Total 65 items en el registry (54 ui + 9\nblocks + tokens + utils).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d93949709e46cd44e132a559832c3c9341a572ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/git/trees/d93949709e46cd44e132a559832c3c9341a572ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/git/commits/749e5f8b8a42563ac05b1cf4dc777f57bcb18e2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1822968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VeNoMZiTo","id":1822968,"login":"VeNoMZiTo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjI5Njg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commit/749e5f8b8a42563ac05b1cf4dc777f57bcb18e2a","node_id":"C_kwDOSVJ1vdoAKDc0OWU1ZjhiOGE0MjU2M2FjMDViMWNmNGRjNzc3ZjU3YmNiMThlMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commit/0033c4418c38eb4695175b906ae2e182c8e04b13","sha":"0033c4418c38eb4695175b906ae2e182c8e04b13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits/0033c4418c38eb4695175b906ae2e182c8e04b13"}],"sha":"749e5f8b8a42563ac05b1cf4dc777f57bcb18e2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits/749e5f8b8a42563ac05b1cf4dc777f57bcb18e2a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1822968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VeNoMZiTo","id":1822968,"login":"VeNoMZiTo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjI5Njg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits/0033c4418c38eb4695175b906ae2e182c8e04b13/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T21:15:50Z","email":"venomzito@gmail.com","name":"Adrián Ramos Medina"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T21:15:50Z","email":"venomzito@gmail.com","name":"Adrián Ramos Medina"},"message":"feat(tei-ui): theme-provider, theme-toggle, data-table y sidebar genericos\n\nCierra el set: cualquier proyecto puede instalar el registry y tener\ndesde tokens hasta una pantalla completa con sidebar + data-table +\ntoggle de tema.\n\n- theme-provider: Provider con localStorage + matchMedia ''system'',\n  aplica data-theme al <html>. SSR-safe. Sin dependencia de next-themes.\n- theme-toggle: boton icono Sun/Moon que conmuta claro <-> oscuro.\n- data-table: wrapper de @tanstack/react-table con sort, filtro,\n  paginacion cliente. Recibe columns + data como props.\n- sidebar: shell generico con `sections` + `items`. El renderer del\n  Link se inyecta para Next.js (next/link), react-router o `<a>` plano.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b2d809523cabe3315456640124b642256a63c0d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/git/trees/b2d809523cabe3315456640124b642256a63c0d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/git/commits/0033c4418c38eb4695175b906ae2e182c8e04b13","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1822968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/gist