"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits/f8f7b320daf3162da204bc26fe940b1576e153bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T21:15:31Z","email":"venomzito@gmail.com","name":"Adrián Ramos Medina"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T21:15:31Z","email":"venomzito@gmail.com","name":"Adrián Ramos Medina"},"message":"fix(chat): cambiar al modelo de visión automáticamente al adjuntar una imagen\n\nSi el modelo de chat actual no admite imágenes, al usar la varita (\"iterar\") sobre una generación\no al adjuntar una imagen manualmente, el sistema buscaba en el catálogo el primer modelo CHAT con\n`supportsImages:true`, lo selecciona y procesa el upload con el set nuevo de capacidades.\n\nAntes: \"El modelo no admite imágenes\" → flujo bloqueado.\nAhora: toast informativo + cambio transparente + adjunto añadido al composer.\n\nSi NINGÚN modelo del chat tiene visión, sí se muestra el error (que el admin habilite uno como\nGLM-4V). Compatible con varita, file picker manual y drag-drop sobre la página.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f8bd21b955c1ecdb6934f4f87273a772499c9f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/git/trees/7f8bd21b955c1ecdb6934f4f87273a772499c9f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/git/commits/f8f7b320daf3162da204bc26fe940b1576e153bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1822968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VeNoMZiTo","id":1822968,"login":"VeNoMZiTo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjI5Njg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commit/f8f7b320daf3162da204bc26fe940b1576e153bd","node_id":"C_kwDOSVJ1vdoAKGY4ZjdiMzIwZGFmMzE2MmRhMjA0YmMyNmZlOTQwYjE1NzZlMTUzYmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commit/1e5c81cff19f0d5eb2c125e91e751224f311d371","sha":"1e5c81cff19f0d5eb2c125e91e751224f311d371","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits/1e5c81cff19f0d5eb2c125e91e751224f311d371"}],"sha":"f8f7b320daf3162da204bc26fe940b1576e153bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits/f8f7b320daf3162da204bc26fe940b1576e153bd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1822968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VeNoMZiTo","id":1822968,"login":"VeNoMZiTo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjI5Njg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits/1e5c81cff19f0d5eb2c125e91e751224f311d371/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T21:07:53Z","email":"venomzito@gmail.com","name":"Adrián Ramos Medina"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T21:07:53Z","email":"venomzito@gmail.com","name":"Adrián Ramos Medina"},"message":"feat(tei-ui): chart, typography, empty-state, kbd, spinner, status-dot\n\nCierra el set canonico de shadcn + utilidades TEI propias:\n\n- chart: wrapper de recharts con --color-<key> dinamico por serie y\n  ChartTooltipContent / ChartLegendContent estilados con tokens TEI.\n  Soporta tema claro/oscuro automatico.\n- typography: H1..H4, P, Blockquote, List, Lead, Muted, Large, Small —\n  jerarquia coherente para contenido editorial.\n- empty-state: pantalla vacia con icono opcional, titulo, descripcion\n  y acciones. Patron repetido en muchas pantallas.\n- kbd: pista visual de teclado.\n- spinner: wrapper de Loader2 con size y color por tokens.\n- status-dot: punto de estado con variantes semanticas y pulse opcional.\n\n50 primitivos + tokens + utils = 52 items en el registry.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c32dd011b914bddd657ea5e7c311fb156f9f5f72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/git/trees/c32dd011b914bddd657ea5e7c311fb156f9f5f72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/git/commits/1e5c81cff19f0d5eb2c125e91e751224f311d371","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1822968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VeNoMZiTo","id":1822968,"login":"VeNoMZiTo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjI5Njg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commit/1e5c81cff19f0d5eb2c125e91e751224f311d371","node_id":"C_kwDOSVJ1vdoAKDFlNWM4MWNmZjE5ZjBkNWViMmMxMjVlOTFlNzUxMjI0ZjMxMWQzNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commit/864008388a37fac6012c660b97b38f1078577fe9","sha":"864008388a37fac6012c660b97b38f1078577fe9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits/864008388a37fac6012c660b97b38f1078577fe9"}],"sha":"1e5c81cff19f0d5eb2c125e91e751224f311d371","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits/1e5c81cff19f0d5eb2c125e91e751224f311d371"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1822968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VeNoMZiTo","id":1822968,"login":"VeNoMZiTo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjI5Njg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits/864008388a37fac6012c660b97b38f1078577fe9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T18:14:06Z","email":"venomzito@gmail.com","name":"Adrián Ramos Medina"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T18:14:06Z","email":"venomzito@gmail.com","name":"Adrián Ramos Medina"},"message":"feat(tei-ui): 31 nuevos primitivos — accordion, alert, select, popover, calendar y mas\n\nHasta 44 componentes ui en el registry. Se anaden:\n\n- Forms: checkbox, radio-group, switch, select, slider, form (rhf), input-otp\n- Layout: aspect-ratio, scroll-area, separator (ya estaba), tabs, accordion\n- Feedback: alert, alert-dialog, progress, skeleton, sonner (toast)\n- Overlays: popover, tooltip, hover-card, drawer (vaul)\n- Navigation: breadcrumb, pagination, navigation-menu, menubar, context-menu, command (cmdk)\n- Date: calendar (react-day-picker)\n- Media: carousel (embla), toggle, toggle-group\n\nTodos siguen el mismo patron: Radix donde aplique + tokens --tei-* + cn()\nde @/lib/utils. Cero clases Tailwind crudas. shadcn add resuelve deps\ninternas automaticamente; las dependencias npm se declaran en cada item.\n\nREADME actualizado con la lista plana de los 44 primitivos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"392025f670635f7c3bb62f293fe80fd99182e5ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/git/trees/392025f670635f7c3bb62f293fe80fd99182e5ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/git/commits/864008388a37fac6012c660b97b38f1078577fe9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1822968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VeNoMZiTo","id":1822968,"login":"VeNoMZiTo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjI5Njg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commit/864008388a37fac6012c660b97b38f1078577fe9","node_id":"C_kwDOSVJ1vdoAKDg2NDAwODM4OGEzN2ZhYzYwMTJjNjYwYjk3YjM4ZjEwNzg1NzdmZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commit/64b492661fa71abf9df690f29a4379ac590e4644","sha":"64b492661fa71abf9df690f29a4379ac590e4644","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits/64b492661fa71abf9df690f29a4379ac590e4644"}],"sha":"864008388a37fac6012c660b97b38f1078577fe9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits/864008388a37fac6012c660b97b38f1078577fe9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1822968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VeNoMZiTo","id":1822968,"login":"VeNoMZiTo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjI5Njg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits/64b492661fa71abf9df690f29a4379ac590e4644/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T17:58:39Z","email":"venomzito@gmail.com","name":"Adrián Ramos Medina"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T17:58:39Z","email":"venomzito@gmail.com","name":"Adrián Ramos Medina"},"message":"feat(tei-ui): registry shadcn-compatible con tokens, utils y 13 componentes\n\nEmpaqueta el sistema de diseno TEI como un registry shadcn que cualquier\nproyecto Next 15 + Tailwind 4 puede consumir con una sola linea:\n\n  npx shadcn@latest add https://<HOST>/r/<item>.json\n\nIncluye:\n- r/tokens.json   — CSS vars TEI + Nunito + JetBrains Mono (latin + ext)\n- r/utils.json    — helper cn() (clsx + tailwind-merge)\n- 13 componentes ui (button, dialog, sheet, card, input, label, textarea,\n  separator, dropdown-menu, avatar, badge, table, code)\n- public/fonts/   — 16 WOFF2 self-hosted (Nunito + JetBrains Mono)\n- scripts/build-registry.ts — genera r/*.json detectando deps\n- scripts/download-fonts.ts — copia para que el cliente pueble public/fonts\n- README.md       — instalacion en 5 pasos, lista de items, hosting\n\nTodos los componentes ya usan los tokens --tei-* del sistema; el cliente\nsolo tiene que instalar `tokens` antes que cualquier `ui`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"319a1d95e69f9ed4fe6d851208032d0f2d22cdbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/git/trees/319a1d95e69f9ed4fe6d851208032d0f2d22cdbc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/git/commits/64b492661fa71abf9df690f29a4379ac590e4644","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1822968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VeNoMZiTo","id":1822968,"login":"VeNoMZiTo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjI5Njg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VeNoMZiTo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commit/64b492661fa71abf9df690f29a4379ac590e4644","node_id":"C_kwDOSVJ1vdoAKDY0YjQ5MjY2MWZhNzFhYmY5ZGY2OTBmMjlhNDM3OWFjNTkwZTQ2NDQ","parents":[],"sha":"64b492661fa71abf9df690f29a4379ac590e4644","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits/64b492661fa71abf9df690f29a4379ac590e4644"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/DimensionTEI/tei-ui/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=890e9fbd66aaff2b7efc649ea2d2ba1a60b6d7d9&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A00%3A10.745Z"}');
