t/commits/21d383e75d0cf3ad86552288216c4dc7fc7447a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commit/21d383e75d0cf3ad86552288216c4dc7fc7447a6","node_id":"C_kwDOSVQQitoAKDIxZDM4M2U3NWQwY2YzYWQ4NjU1MjI4ODIxNmM0ZGM3ZmM3NDQ3YTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commit/ebd4efaa4ce5086ed650385969abff8036b0a471","sha":"ebd4efaa4ce5086ed650385969abff8036b0a471","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/ebd4efaa4ce5086ed650385969abff8036b0a471"}],"sha":"21d383e75d0cf3ad86552288216c4dc7fc7447a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/21d383e75d0cf3ad86552288216c4dc7fc7447a6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/ebd4efaa4ce5086ed650385969abff8036b0a471/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T12:20:20Z","email":"ci-bot@eigen.ga","name":"EIGEN CI Bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T12:20:20Z","email":"ci-bot@eigen.ga","name":"EIGEN CI Bot"},"message":"fix(primary-nav): webpack module not found — import via @eigen/esm-framework\n\nCAUSE : root.component.tsx importait CompactTopBar depuis\n  ''@eigen/esm-styleguide/src/layouts/TopBarContent''\nCe chemin n''est PAS dans le exports map du package styleguide\n→ webpack ne peut pas le résoudre → build exit(1).\n\nFIX : import depuis ''@eigen/esm-framework'' (point d''entrée unique\ndes MFEs, déclaré singleton dans vite.config.mf.ts) :\n  import { ThemeProvider, TopBarContent } from ''@eigen/esm-framework''\n\nChaîne de résolution validée :\n  @eigen/esm-framework → src/index.ts\n    → export * from ''@eigen/esm-styleguide/src/public''\n      → ThemeProvider ✓  TopBarContent ✓\n\nMême correction appliquée dans root.component.test.tsx :\n  vi.mock(''@eigen/esm-styleguide/src/layouts/TopBarContent'')\n  → vi.mock(''@eigen/esm-framework'', { TopBarContent: mock })","tree":{"sha":"58bb35316dcbf69f818b534ff9350048a3bbf1ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/trees/58bb35316dcbf69f818b534ff9350048a3bbf1ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/commits/ebd4efaa4ce5086ed650385969abff8036b0a471","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commit/ebd4efaa4ce5086ed650385969abff8036b0a471","node_id":"C_kwDOSVQQitoAKGViZDRlZmFhNGNlNTA4NmVkNjUwMzg1OTY5YWJmZjgwMzZiMGE0NzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commit/286f44debcaac3f31168c181e54406b8042e6a66","sha":"286f44debcaac3f31168c181e54406b8042e6a66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/286f44debcaac3f31168c181e54406b8042e6a66"}],"sha":"ebd4efaa4ce5086ed650385969abff8036b0a471","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/ebd4efaa4ce5086ed650385969abff8036b0a471"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/286f44debcaac3f31168c181e54406b8042e6a66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T07:37:59Z","email":"ci-bot@eigen.ga","name":"EIGEN CI Bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T07:38:05Z","email":"ci-bot@eigen.ga","name":"EIGEN CI Bot"},"message":"fix(tooling/egen): TS2322/TS2345 — yargs array options typed as string[]\n\n## Problème\nLes 6 erreurs TypeScript rapportées lors du build erano :\n\n  TS2322 / TS2345 : Type ''(string | number)[]'' is not assignable to type ''string[]''\n\nCAUSE : yargs infère le type de toute option .option(''x'', { type: ''array'' })\ncomme (string | number)[] même si l''option n''accepte que des strings.\nLes interfaces de commandes (DebugArgs, DevelopArgs, BuildArgs) déclarent\nces champs comme Array<string> → incompatibilité TypeScript.\n\n## Correction — packages/tooling/egen/src/cli.ts\n\nPour chaque option array qui doit être string[] :\n  - default: []       → default: [] as string[]   (infère le type correct)\n  - pas de coerce     → coerce: (a: unknown[]) => a.map(String)\n                        (coerce garantit string[] à l''exécution ET au niveau des types\n                         car TS infère le return type de la fonction de coerce)\n\nOptions corrigées (×2 car présentes dans debug + develop) :\n  --config-url     : 2 occurrences\n  --config-file    : 2 occurrences\n  --sources        : 2 occurrences\n  --shared-deps    : 2 occurrences\n  --config-url (build) : 1 occurrence\nTotal : 9 coerce ajoutés, 6 erreurs TS résolues.\n\nNote : tsconfig.json remis à l''état original (moduleResolution:node).\nLa dépréciation TS5107 n''existe qu''en TS ≥ 6.x ; le projet cible TS 5.8.3.","tree":{"sha":"d0fc89a1a2c4e7ee9d5610f31d5b126fc582414f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/trees/d0fc89a1a2c4e7ee9d5610f31d5b126fc582414f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/commits/286f44debcaac3f31168c181e54406b8042e6a66","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commit/286f44debcaac3f31168c181e54406b8042e6a66","node_id":"C_kwDOSVQQitoAKDI4NmY0NGRlYmNhYWMzZjMxMTY4YzE4MWU1NDQwNmI4MDQyZTZhNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commit/591cd860d2a0388c526de3f4e72ac98b8c8d3b02","sha":"591cd860d2a0388c526de3f4e72ac98b8c8d3b02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/591cd860d2a0388c526de3f4e72ac98b8c8d3b02"}],"sha":"286f44debcaac3f31168c181e54406b8042e6a66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/286f44debcaac3f31168c181e54406b8042e6a66"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/591cd860d2a0388c526de3f4e72ac98b8c8d3b02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T07:30:15Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.