0c8d43159f02ee035"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/commits/df4a7957c07fa04b6546de14efc6aab96a90d7f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commit/df4a7957c07fa04b6546de14efc6aab96a90d7f8","node_id":"C_kwDOSVQQitoAKGRmNGE3OTU3YzA3ZmEwNGI2NTQ2ZGUxNGVmYzZhYWI5NmE5MGQ3Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commit/8659f8c7c73cd04c01b5b72379645a79145545c4","sha":"8659f8c7c73cd04c01b5b72379645a79145545c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/8659f8c7c73cd04c01b5b72379645a79145545c4"}],"sha":"df4a7957c07fa04b6546de14efc6aab96a90d7f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/df4a7957c07fa04b6546de14efc6aab96a90d7f8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/0a2bb6133cc04e3e9ea72b2ca0dbc9168ff9a181/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T07:24:27Z","email":"ci-bot@eigen.ga","name":"EIGEN CI Bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T07:24:27Z","email":"ci-bot@eigen.ga","name":"EIGEN CI Bot"},"message":"fix(ui): AnimateAgentAI + MagicRings — whitespace scroll + canvas overflow\n\n## Problèmes corrigés\n\n### 1. Faux margin-top / scroll sur la page login\nCAUSE : AnimateAgentAI utilisait className=''fixed top-0 left-0'' (Tailwind).\nOr esm-styleguide n''a pas de tailwind.config → ces classes ne sont jamais\ngénérées dans le CSS final → div en position:static → 48px dans le flux\nnormal → illusion de padding-top + scroll vertical.\n\nFIX : position:''fixed'' en style inline React. Garanti, sans dépendance\nau pipeline Tailwind.\n\n### 2. Anneaux hors canvas (4/6 rings clippés silencieusement)\nCAUSE : baseRadius=0.35 + radiusStep=0.1 → ring 5 atteignait r=40.8px\ndans un canvas de 48px de haut (centre y=24) → s''étendait de y=-16 à y=65\n→ 4 anneaux débordaient → clip canvas + artefacts visuels.\n\nFIX (MagicRings) : plafonnement interne MAX_REL_RADIUS=0.45. Chaque rayon\nest cappé à 0.45*min(bufferW,bufferH). Plus aucun débordement possible.\n\nFIX (AnimateAgentAI) : baseRadius=0.10 + radiusStep=0.07 → ring max=19.8px\ndans min(cx,cy)=22px ✓ Tous les 6 anneaux visibles et propres.\n\n### 3. Désynchronisation canvas CSS vs buffer\nCAUSE : canvas sans CSS width/height → taille CSS = attributs HTML.\nFragile si le parent change de taille.\n\nFIX (MagicRings) : style={{ width:''100%'', height:''100%'' }} sur le canvas.\nIl remplit exactement son parent CSS. Les attributs width/height deviennent\nla résolution du buffer (indépendant de la taille affichée).\n\n### 4. Canvas légèrement réduit (demande utilisateur)\n80×48 → 60×44 px. overflow:hidden sur le wrapper interne.","tree":{"sha":"4a9ef4b9e11b157606c7c3f15e7735934d67de38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/trees/4a9ef4b9e11b157606c7c3f15e7735934d67de38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/commits/0a2bb6133cc04e3e9ea72b2ca0dbc9168ff9a181","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commit/0a2bb6133cc04e3e9ea72b2ca0dbc9168ff9a181","node_id":"C_kwDOSVQQitoAKDBhMmJiNjEzM2NjMDRlM2U5ZWE3MmIyY2EwZGJjOTE2OGZmOWExODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commit/8659f8c7c73cd04c01b5b72379645a79145545c4","sha":"8659f8c7c73cd04c01b5b72379645a79145545c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/8659f8c7c73cd04c01b5b72379645a79145545c4"}],"sha":"0a2bb6133cc04e3e9ea72b2ca0dbc9168ff9a181","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/0a2bb6133cc04e3e9ea72b2ca0dbc9168ff9a181"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/8659f8c7c73cd04c01b5b72379645a79145545c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T09:39:05Z","email":"ci-bot@eigen.ga","name":"EIGEN CI Bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T09:39:05Z","email":"ci-bot@eigen.ga","name":"EIGEN CI Bot"},"message":"fix(nav): whitespace bug + integrate CompactTopBar in primary-nav\n\n## Fix : espace blanc en haut de la page login\n\nCAUSE : Le div .primaryNavContainer (height: var(--eigen-topnav-height) = 48px)\nétait toujours monté par Single SPA, même sur /login où Navbar retournait null.\nRésultat : 48px de hauteur fantôme en tête de la page de connexion.\n\nFIX : NavShell (fils de BrowserRouter) lit useLocation() et retourne null\nsur les routes /login et /logout → aucun div n''est injecté dans le DOM.\n\n## Feature : CompactTopBar remplace l''ancien Carbon Header\n\n- root.component.tsx : ThemeProvider → BrowserRouter → NavShell → CompactTopBar\n- root.scss : height passe de --eigen-topnav-height (48px) à --header-height (64px)\n- _main-content.scss : --eigen-navbar-height et --eigen-topnav-height\n  pointent désormais sur var(--header-height, 64px) pour aligner tous les\n  composants framework (side-nav, panels, workspaces) sur la vraie hauteur.\n- package.json : @eigen/esm-styleguide et @eigen/esm-auth ajoutés en peerDeps\n  (déjà singletons dans vite.config.mf.ts → pas de bundle dupliqué).\n- root.component.test.tsx : tests réécrits pour la nouvelle architecture.","tree":{"sha":"cadb33b35b9a9905fcdf7de26b8928f0670b2257","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/trees/cadb33b35b9a9905fcdf7de26b8928f0670b2257"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/commits/8659f8c7c73cd04c01b5b72379645a79145545c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commit/8659f8c7c73cd04c01b5b72379645a79145545c4","node_id":"C_kwDOSVQQitoAKDg2NTlmOGM3YzczY2QwNGMwMWI1YjcyMzc5NjQ1YTc5MTQ1NTQ1YzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commit/23f87efc455d7ee8f6cbb57d80c17a10789becb2","sha":"23f87efc455d7ee8f6cbb57d80c17a10789becb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/23f87efc455d7ee8f6cbb57d80c17a10789becb2"}],"sha":"8659f8c7c73cd04c01b5b72379645a79145545c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/8659f8c7c73cd04c01b5b72379645a79145545c4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/23f87efc455d7ee8f6cbb57d80c17a10789becb2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T08:51:02Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T08:51:02Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(leftbar): LeftBarContent — thème dynamique + améliorations UI\n\n- Import useTheme (chemin relatif ../theme, évite cycles)\n- Import Moon + Sun (lucide) pour le toggle thème dans le footer\n- useTheme() → isDark + toggleDarkMode consommés dans le composant\n- Toggle dark/light ajouté dans le footer sidebar :\n    icône Moon/Sun + label animé (visible en mode expanded)\n    même style NavItem pour cohérence visuelle\n- NavItem :\n    Indicateur actif : barre gauche 2px avec glow primary-400\n    fontWeight semibold sur l''item actif\n    Scale 1.10 sur l''icône au hover (non-actif)\n    Transition fast (100ms) pour background + color\n- avatarStyle :\n    borderRadius sm (carré arrondi) au lieu de full\n    boxShadow var(--shadow-sm) pour profondeur\n    Dimensions revues : sm=1.25rem md=1.75rem\n- SidebarDivider : indenté (padding latéral space-2), opacity 0.6\n- sidebarStyle : willChange:width pour fluidifier la transition\n- CSS vars synchronisées (commentaires explicites)","tree":{"sha":"8c277c3aae1acedcb416eb3cf7e2d93387b1965e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/trees/8c277c3aae1acedcb416eb3cf7e2d93387b1965e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/commits/23f87efc455d7ee8f6cbb57d80c17a10789becb2","verification":