ar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/8fde3b36d695511b30612c067a4a56a0b59dd020/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T08:49:05Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T08:49:05Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(topbar): corrections styles et imports — TopBarContent\n\n- Import useTheme/useThemeVariables : chemin relatif ../theme\n  (élimine dépendance cyclique @egen/esm-styleguide/theme depuis\n  l''intérieur du package esm-styleguide)\n- Import useAuth + useIAMAuth fusionnés en une seule ligne\n- useHover factory (définie dans le composant, violation hooks rules)\n  → useHoverState() custom hook propre déclaré hors du composant\n- Wrapper TopBar : paddingLeft=var(--sidebar-collapsed) pour\n  compenser la largeur de la sidebar icône-only\n- Barre principale : borderBottom via --border-divider, flex:1\n- Logout button : rgba(var(--error-500),0.10) invalide CSS corrigé\n  → rgba(239,68,68,0.10) valide\n- Badge notification : taille/style enrichi, halo de contraste,\n  compteur visible (3), boxShadow thème\n- Breadcrumb : icône Home colorée + label actif fontWeight medium\n- Bouton Configurations : style xs uppercase accent dot primary-400","tree":{"sha":"40ca9cf46cf9a9656ff89e910f6dbc58b999bb97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/trees/40ca9cf46cf9a9656f