lowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/d6837c7c4b4bb7fe478bf94f3490bfd7edfc1be1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T08:39:44Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T08:39:44Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(fields): OutlinedField avec validation animée dans le login\n\nfields.tsx — refonte complète :\n- labelBg prop : fond du label flottant configurable (glass, card, etc.)\n- rightPadding prop : padding droit dynamique (libère l''espace pour le\n  bouton eye + icône validation sans chevauchement)\n- VALIDATION_COLORS : 100% via CSS vars du thème (--success/error/warning-*)\n- ValidationMessage : composant dédié avec fade+translateY animé\n- ValidationIcon enrichie : transition entre états (exit → enter),\n  couleur avec drop-shadow glow thématique\n- 4 keyframes CSS inline :\n    validIconShake  → secoue l''icône sur error\n    validIconBounce → rebond sur success\n    validIconSlide  → slide-in standard\n    fieldShake      → secoue le conteneur entier sur error\n- debounceMs : validation temps-réel avec délai configurable\n- animationType : tracking de l''animation en cours pour\n  ne déclencher que le bon keyframe\n\nCredentialsForm (LoginOrbitalAuth) — intégration complète :\n- ValidationConfig username : error < 3 chars, warning chars invalides,\n  success pattern complet\n- ValidationConfig password : error < 6 chars, warning sans chiffres/\n  symboles, success pattern robuste\n- labelBg=GLASS_BG (rgba(9,9,18,0.82)) → label coupe la bordure glass\n- rightPadding dynamique sur password : 4.5rem si validation visible,\n  2.75rem sinon (espace pour bouton eye ET icône validation)\n- Bouton eye : right transite (CSS) de 0.75rem → 2.5rem quand une\n  icône de validation apparaît — jamais de chevauchement\n- forceError : loginError serveur propage l''état error sur les deux\n  champs via une ValidationConfig dédiée\n- isFormReady = username.success && password.success : bouton activé\n  seulement quand les deux champs sont validés\n- Le bouton Se connecter change de gradient quand le formulaire est prêt\n\npublic.ts : OutlinedField, FilledField, StandardField + tous les types\n  (BaseFieldProps, ValidationConfig, ValidationRule, FieldIcon) désormais\n  accessibles depuis @egen/esm-framework pour toute l''application.","tree":{"sha":"ef29770f37370ba3629543f1ef3867628a3bb689","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/trees/ef29770f37370ba3629543f1ef3867628a3bb689"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/commits/d6837c7c4b4bb7fe478bf94f3490bfd7edfc1be1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":