ts","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/a75f0704e6c2b4496902699ab3fdb329029d7cee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T11:09:21Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T11:09:21Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(shell): add dev script alias for turbo dev pipeline\n\nturbo.json définit un task ''dev'' (persistent: true) mais le shell\nn''avait que ''watch''. Turbo ne trouvait pas de script ''dev'' dans le\nshell, buildait tout (cache hits, 578ms) et sortait proprement sans\njamais démarrer le webpack-dev-server.\n\nFix: ajout de \"dev\": \"npm run watch\" dans le shell.\n\nDésormais ''npm run dev:mock'' démarre correctement :\n  [0] Express mock server  → http://localhost:3333\n  [1] webpack-dev-server   → http://localhost:8080/igen/spa/","tree":{"sha":"869e41789a1a0d3977530a4d10c7441ca51bb09d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/trees/869e41789a1a0d3977530a4d10c7441ca51bb09d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/commits/a75f0704e6c2b4496902699ab3fdb329029d7cee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/