":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/0793820cc149e98f60345ccc71a581cad3145a33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T23:01:29Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T23:01:29Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: esm-shared-types — suppression dépendances circulaires\n\n- base.ts: types primitifs sans dépendances (IPermission, IGroupe, AccessLevel...)\n- auth.ts: IRole + ISession + IAuthInfo, importe depuis base.ts\n- permissions.ts: IHabilitations + checks, importe depuis base.ts et auth.ts\n- index.ts: re-exports propres sans doublons\n\nBuild: 0 erreur TS ✅","tree":{"sha":"e3dfa7fe19cca870832f406a71b4b41525f275d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/trees/e3dfa7fe19cca870832f406a71b4b41525f275d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/commits/0793820cc149e98f60345ccc71a581cad3145a33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commit/0793820cc149e98f60345ccc71a581cad3145a33","node_id":"C_kwDOSVQQitoAKDA3OTM4MjBjYzE0OWU5OGY2MDM0NWNjYzcxYTU4MWNhZDMxNDVhMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commit/b3043b3442e44d0b21ceb456bd26dd331be346e2","sha":"b3043b3442e44d0b21ceb456bd26dd331be346e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/b3043b3442e44d0b21ceb456bd26dd331be346e2"}],"sha":"0793820cc149e98f60345ccc71a581cad3145a33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/0793820cc149e98f60345ccc71a581cad3145a33"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/b3043b3442e44d0b21ceb456bd26dd331be346e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T11:16:53Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T11:16:53Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: extensionAlias directement dans rspack.config.js de esm-styleguide\n\nDiagnostic final:\n  esm-styleguide a sa PROPRE rspack.config.js inline — elle n''utilise pas\n  le tooling rspack-config. Mon fix précédent dans rspack-config/dist\n  n''avait aucun effet sur ce package. Turbo cache = cache hit car les\n  fichiers de esm-styleguide n''avaient pas changé.\n\nCorrections dans packages/framework/esm-styleguide/rspack.config.js:\n  1. resolve.extensionAlias ajouté directement:\n       ''.js''  → [''.ts'', ''.tsx'', ''.js'']   ← résout internal.ts et tous les .js\n       ''.jsx'' → [''.tsx'', ''.jsx'']\n       ''.mjs'' → [''.mts'', ''.mjs'']\n       ''.cjs'' → [''.cts'', ''.cjs'']\n     Ref: https://rspack.rs/config/resolve#resolveextensionalias\n\n  2. Bug swc-loader corrigé: options était au niveau de la règle (ignoré),\n     maintenant correctement placé dans l''objet use{}\n\n  3. internal.ts: imports avec extensions .js explicites\n     (TypeScript ESM standard, géré par extensionAlias)\n\n  4. resolve.alias ''@/'' → src/ maintenu pour compatibilité\n\nRésultat: rspack compiled with 0 errors ✅ (test local confirmé)","tree":{"sha":"4bde6985f515451ed29f91fcf38c42bd96266e71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/trees/4bde6985f515451ed29f91fcf38c42bd96266e71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/commits/b3043b3442e44d0b21ceb456bd26dd331be346e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commit/b3043b3442e44d0b21ceb456bd26dd331be346e2","node_id":"C_kwDOSVQQitoAKGIzMDQzYjM0NDJlNDRkMGIyMWNlYjQ1NmJkMjZkZDMzMWJlMzQ2ZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commit/c0d2ec2a9e37a85820ebbf894a0c8ecaa344421b","sha":"c0d2ec2a9e37a85820ebbf894a0c8ecaa344421b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/c0d2ec2a9e37a85820ebbf894a0c8ecaa344421b"}],"sha":"b3043b3442e44d0b21ceb456bd26dd331be346e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/b3043b3442e44d0b21ceb456bd26dd331be346e2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/c0d2ec2a9e37a85820ebbf894a0c8ecaa344421b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T11:06:51Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T11:06:51Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: committer les dist/ tooling + extensionAlias garanti au clone\n\nProblème racine identifié:\n  dist/ est gitignored globalement → rspack-config/dist et webpack-config/dist\n  ne sont jamais distribués dans le repo. Résultat: turbo utilise son cache\n  local (stale) sans jamais avoir le nouveau dist avec extensionAlias. L''erreur\n  persiste même après git pull car le dist n''est pas rebuilt automatiquement.\n\nDouble fix:\n  1. Committer les dist/ de rspack-config et webpack-config avec git add -f\n     → Le nouveau dist/ avec extensionAlias est maintenant dans le repo\n     → Disponible dès le clone, sans besoin de rebuild tooling en premier\n     → Turbo détectera un cache-miss car les fichiers changent\n\n  2. .gitignore locaux dans les toolings excluent explicitement dist/\n     → Protège contre un futur git clean qui effacerait les dist committé\n\n  3. extensionAlias dans les deux configs bundlers:\n       ''.js'' → [''.ts'', ''.tsx'', ''.js'']   // TypeScript ESM imports\n       ''.jsx'' → [''.tsx'', ''.jsx'']\n       ''.mjs'' → [''.mts'', ''.mjs'']\n\n  4. internal.ts + public.ts: imports sans extension .js (déjà propres)\n\nRésultat attendu après git pull:\n  - turbo voit dist/index.js changé → cache-miss rspack-config ✅\n  - esm-styleguide rebuild avec le nouveau rspack qui résout .js → .ts ✅\n  - Tout le monorepo build sans erreur ✅","tree":{"sha":"c0f2df2a5da341f7dfa37182789822f33adddfc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/trees/c0f2df2a5da341f7dfa37182789822f33adddfc2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/commits/c0d2ec2a9e37a85820ebbf894a0c8ecaa344421b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commit/c0d2ec2a9e37a85820ebbf894a0c8ecaa344421b","node_id":"C_kwDOSVQQitoAKGMwZDJlYzJhOWUzN2E4NTgyMGViYmY4OTRhMGM4ZWNhYTM0NDQyMWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commit/35ab3149880640009fada806ea97d1ec32931ee6","sha":"35ab3149880640009fada806ea97d1ec32931ee6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/35ab3149880640009fada806ea97d1ec32931ee6"}],"sha":"c0d2ec2a9e37a85820ebbf894a0c8ecaa344421b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/c0d2ec2a9e37a85820ebbf894a0c8ecaa344421b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/35ab3149880640009fada806ea97d1ec32931ee6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T11:02:11Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T11:02:11Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: extensionAlias dans rspack-config + webpack-config — solution long terme\n\nProblème racine:\n  internal.ts et autres fichiers utilisent des imports TypeScript ESM avec\n  extensions .js explicites (ex: ''./breakpoints/index.js''), imposées par\n  moduleResolution: ''node16'' | ''bundler''. Rspack/webpack ne pouvaient pas\n  les résoudre vers les fichiers .ts correspondants.\n\nSolution:\n  Ajout de extensionAlias dans resolve{} des deux configs bundlers:\n    ''.js''  → [''.ts'', ''.tsx'', ''.js'']\n    ''.jsx'' → [''.tsx'', ''.jsx'']\n    ''.mjs'' → [''.mts'', ''.mjs'']\n\nPourquoi c''est la bonne solution long terme:\n  - Un seul point de configuration couvre TOUT le monorepo\n  - Aucun fichier source à modifier (ni maintenant ni dans le futur)\n  - Supporte tous les 