:null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commit/4efaf5238d7fc297a40c2d04e5f639c23655d299","node_id":"C_kwDOSVQQitoAKDRlZmFmNTIzOGQ3ZmMyOTdhNDBjMmQwNGU1ZjYzOWMyMzY1NWQyOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commit/657f701013428d374bb02db7f45d57addcd8c408","sha":"657f701013428d374bb02db7f45d57addcd8c408","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/657f701013428d374bb02db7f45d57addcd8c408"}],"sha":"4efaf5238d7fc297a40c2d04e5f639c23655d299","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/4efaf5238d7fc297a40c2d04e5f639c23655d299"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/657f701013428d374bb02db7f45d57addcd8c408/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T20:02:06Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T20:02:11Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(auth): correction système refresh/vérification token Keycloak\n\nPROBLÈME CORRIGÉ :\n- useSessionMonitor appelait /api/auth/session (Next.js Route Handler inexistant dans Vite)\n- scheduleTokenRefresh ne détectait pas la révocation Keycloak\n- getSession ne vérifiait pas la validité de la session côté Keycloak lors de la restauration\n\nCORRECTIONS :\n1. useSessionMonitor → appel direct Keycloak userinfo OIDC\n   - GET /realms/{realm}/protocol/openid-connect/userinfo\n   - 401/403 = session révoquée → logout immédiat\n   - 5xx/timeout = failsafe (session conservée)\n   - Vérification forcée au focus fenêtre et retour onglet\n\n2. scheduleTokenRefresh → détection révocation Keycloak\n   - invalid_grant / session_not_active / token_expired → logout propre via onRevoked()\n   - Erreur réseau transitoire → retry dans 30s (pas de logout)\n   - Signature étendue : scheduleTokenRefresh(onRefreshed, onRevoked)\n\n3. getSession → vérification Keycloak userinfo à la restauration\n   - Token en mémoire : vérifié via userinfo avant de valider la session\n   - Token sessionStorage : même vérification\n   - Refresh token : appel Keycloak avec gestion 400/401\n\n4. AuthProvider → câblage du callback onRevoked\n   - Hydratation + login branchés sur doLogout(false) si révocation\n\nfeat(multitenant): système d''extraction multi-niveaux de sous-domaines\n\nNouveau module : src/lib/subdomain-resolver.ts\n- resolveSubdomains(options) → extraction N niveaux configurables\n- getSubdomainAt(level) → sous-domaine à un niveau précis\n- getSubdomainsList(levels) → liste de sous-domaines pour N niveaux\n- getTopSubdomain() → tenant principal\n- useSubdomains() → hook React\n\nNiveau 1 = plus proche du domaine racine, N = plus éloigné (tenant)\nExemple : client.region.org.iam-central.ga\n  niveau 1 → org, niveau 2 → region, niveau 3 → client\n\nrealm-resolver.ts mis à jour pour utiliser subdomain-resolver","tree":{"sha":"e13230b54ac53fcc86c1e16e2cc60eb170780cf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/trees/e13230b54ac53fcc86c1e16e2cc60eb170780cf8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/commits/657f701013428d374bb02db7f45d57addcd8c408","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commit/657f701013428d374bb02db7f45d57addcd8c408","node_id":"C_kwDOSVQQitoAKDY1N2Y3MDEwMTM0MjhkMzc0YmIwMmRiN2Y0NWQ1N2FkZGNkOGM0MDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commit/a9c41faaa11abcdc5ec4172821d7f2d986b46e59","sha":"a9c41faaa11abcdc5ec4172821d7f2d986b46e59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/a9c41faaa11abcdc5ec4172821d7f2d986b46e59"}],"sha":"657f701013428d374bb02db7f45d57addcd8c408","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/657f701013428d374bb02db7f45d57addcd8c408"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/a9c41faaa11abcdc5ec4172821d7f2d986b46e59/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T14:26:00Z","email":"NZILASAMUEL2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T14:26:00Z","email