s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/commits/13fba8a78302a54720c278d4ba1deb1bbc7f9ea4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T09:36:30Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T09:36:30Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude AI"},"message":"feat: système auth complet + thème + fixes TopBar\n\n✅ Thème\n- Copie public/themes/default.json depuis IAM (thème glassmorphism complet)\n- themeLoader: fix espacement dot→dash (0.5→0-5), tous les zIndex (sticky, raised, overlay), transitions nommées\n\n✅ Authentification\n- lib/auth/authService.ts : login, logout, session, refresh + auto-refresh proactif\n- lib/auth/AuthProvider.tsx : Context React avec hydratation session, sync Zustand\n- pages/LoginPage.tsx : formulaire login sécurisé avec animations\n\n✅ Architecture Core → Module\n- App.tsx : AuthProvider + routes protégées (RequireAuth) + /login public\n- IAMModule.tsx : CoreContext avec token live (tokenManager) + sync via CustomEvent\n- Proxy vite.config.ts → backend IAM (/api/auth/*)\n\n✅ UI Fixes\n- CoreBaseLayout : TopBar FULL WIDTH (plus de pl-[3.05rem] sur le wrapper), offsets via CSS vars\n- TopBar.tsx : utilise useTheme() de lib/theme (isDark+toggleDarkMode au lieu de hook legacy)\n- TopBarContent : import useAuthContext depuis le vrai AuthProvider\n\n🏗️ Architecture\n  Core: login/logout centralisés, cookies HttpOnly refresh, tokenManager en mémoire\n  Modules: reçoivent coreContext.user.token (token live), sync via CustomEvent core:token-updated","tree":{"sha":"8f6b6fc3e26df60db59da1c1221c2f220d926fc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/trees/8f6b6fc3e26df60db59da1c1221c2f220d926fc4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Core-Frontend-EGEN/git/commits/13fba8a78302a547