","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Layott/evotv-app/commit/3bd70274356c8420b03e0def81505e7af6195091","node_id":"C_kwDOSVUfFtoAKDNiZDcwMjc0MzU2Yzg0MjBiMDNlMGRlZjgxNTA1ZTdhZjYxOTUwOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Layott/evotv-app/commit/e812662d12394b88ae086a2c31f9633f63aa60b5","sha":"e812662d12394b88ae086a2c31f9633f63aa60b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Layott/evotv-app/commits/e812662d12394b88ae086a2c31f9633f63aa60b5"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Layott/evotv-app/commit/90f1abe85d6160587c37339261018dfae96a1ee5","sha":"90f1abe85d6160587c37339261018dfae96a1ee5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Layott/evotv-app/commits/90f1abe85d6160587c37339261018dfae96a1ee5"}],"sha":"3bd70274356c8420b03e0def81505e7af6195091","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Layott/evotv-app/commits/3bd70274356c8420b03e0def81505e7af6195091"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90828865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Layott","id":90828865,"login":"Layott","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwODI4ODY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Layott/evotv-app/commits/90f1abe85d6160587c37339261018dfae96a1ee5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T22:12:23Z","email":"ladilawalt@gmail.com","name":"ladilawalt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T22:12:23Z","email":"ladilawalt@gmail.com","name":"ladilawalt"},"message":"Every merge to main publishes itself to phones\n\nThe website has deployed itself from main since August; the app never did, so a\nfix could sit merged and correct while every phone still ran the last build.\nThat is exactly how the VOD comment thread shipped to nobody earlier today: the\ncomponent was finished, the screen was fixed, main had it, and publishing was\nstill a thing somebody had to remember to do.\n\nA JS-only merge is now typechecked and pushed as an OTA on the channel the\nshipped builds already listen on, with the commit subject as its message.\n\nIt refuses when it cannot be honest about what it is doing. A merge touching\napp config, dependencies or the native directories changes what the binary\ncontains, and an OTA would hand installed apps a bundle expecting native code\nthey do not have; the run stops and says to use `pnpm release:android`, which\nbuilds on EAS and gives the website the same artifact. `[skip ota]` in the\nsubject is the way out for a merge deliberately not meant for phones yet.\n\nTypecheck runs before publishing because there is no staging channel between\nthis job and a viewer''s device.\n\nNeeds `EXPO_TOKEN` set once as a repository secret; the run fails loudly rather\nthan quietly doing nothing without it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014nCiMWkWZJQ6zqSLRLtKtz","tree":{"sha":"b34f7ee99139037c2c9fec87a1041a12fb5bf694","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Layott/evotv-app/git/trees/b34f7ee99139037c2c9fec87a1041a12fb5bf694"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Layott/evotv-app/git/commits/90f1abe85d6160587c37339261018dfae96a1ee5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90828865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Layott","id":90828865,"login":"Layott","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwODI4ODY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Layott/evotv-app/commit/90f1abe85d6160587c37339261018dfae96a1ee5","node_id":"C_kwDOSVUfFtoAKDkwZjFhYmU4NWQ2MTYwNTg3YzM3MzM5MjYxMDE4ZGZhZTk2YTFlZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Layott/evotv-app/commit/e812662d12394b88ae086a2c31f9633f63aa60b5","sha":"e812662d12394b88ae086a2c31f9633f63aa60b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Layott/evotv-app/commits/e812662d12394b88ae086a2c31f9633f63aa60b5"}],"sha":"90f1abe85d6160587c37339261018dfae96a1ee5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Layott/evotv-app/commits/90f1abe85d6160587c37339261018dfae96a1ee5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90828865?v=4","events_url":"https:/