thub.com/users/Layott","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Layott/evotv-app/commits/3c18cf24f5d01ebf2be78ba875ab4215e568bbc9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T12:53:08Z","email":"ladilawalt@gmail.com","name":"ladilawalt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T12:53:08Z","email":"ladilawalt@gmail.com","name":"ladilawalt"},"message":"Four rooms in the app too\n\nThe app copies the ladder from the backend deliberately, so it has to copy the\ntable that replaced it for access. `capabilities.ts` is that copy: rank still\ndecides seniority, a room decides what opens, and nothing is inherited.\n\nThe admin section now gates on the room a screen belongs to rather than a rank,\nwhich is what makes the two new roles work at all: a programmer ranks below\nmoderator, so every rank test hid the dashboard from the person whose job is\nplanning the week. The Admin entry on the profile tab had the same test and the\nsame result.\n\nThe refusal screen says which room is missing rather than which rank, because\n\"Moderator access required\" on the schedule was never true and told nobody\nanything.\n\nPairs with evo-tv#90.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JEPvbznPoLupeJmcBrdvod","tree":{"sha":"c24b594cd2ceb79d13666dd016db315ab24fda61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Layott/evotv-app/git/trees/c24b594cd2ceb79d13666dd016db315ab24fda61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Layott/evotv-app/git/commits/3c18cf24f5d01ebf2be78ba875ab4215e568bbc9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90828865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https