://api.github.com/repos/Layott/evotv-app/commits/b9964fefbf9cb7d860bec308a46256b75cb22181/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T21:21:37Z","email":"ladilawalt@gmail.com","name":"ladilawalt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T21:21:37Z","email":"ladilawalt@gmail.com","name":"ladilawalt"},"message":"Remove the stray class tokens my eyebrow codemod left behind\n\nThe pass that stripped `uppercase tracking-wide|wider|widest` from headings\nused one alternation, and alternation is first-match-wins: `tracking-wider`\nmatched the `wide` branch, so `tracking-wide` was removed and a bare `r` was\nleft standing in the class list. `tracking-widest` left `st` the same way.\n\nNeither is a real utility, so nothing rendered differently and it shipped\nunnoticed. It is litter rather than a bug, but it is litter in 65 class lists\nin this repo, and the next person to read one of them would waste time\nwondering what `r` does.\n\nFound by looking at a class string in a screenshot the owner sent for an\nunrelated reason.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014GkRDBJorYUURn4bkNe7JW","tree":{"sha":"95ba2ebd04d8318f8b1f7495038403a26f7a9038","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Layott/evotv-app/git/trees/95ba2ebd04d8318f8b1f7495038403a26f7a9038"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Layott/evotv-app/git/commits/b9964fefbf9cb7d860bec308a46256b75cb22181","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90828865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Layott/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Layott","id":90828865,"login":"Layott","nod