caro","id":19177327,"login":"leticiazaccaro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTc3MzI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leticiazaccaro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leticiazaccaro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leticiazaccaro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leticiazaccaro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leticiazaccaro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leticiazaccaro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leticiazaccaro/bytebank-app/commits/8a7c728984e9127206dd2cbf80769a265fe47986/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T02:54:51Z","email":"leticia.gabrielly1@gmail.com","name":"Leticia Zacano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T02:54:51Z","email":"leticia.gabrielly1@gmail.com","name":"Leticia Zacano"},"message":"feat(mf-dashboard): compose home page with balance and charts\n\nWires BalanceCard, BalanceChart, and CategoryBreakdownChart into the Home\npage, wrapping the initial statement fetch in a try/catch that renders a\ngeneric retry state on failure (the 401-vs-network distinction and\nauto-logout are T44''s job, once T43''s shared error middleware exists). A\nloading.tsx file-convention skeleton covers the Suspense fallback while\nthe async Server Component awaits data.\n\nAdds a vitest path alias mirroring tsconfig''s \"@/*\" mapping (needed the\nfirst time a test imports through it) and tests the composed page by\ncalling the exported async Server Component function directly and\ninspecting the returned element tree — no DOM renderer needed, consistent\nwith the no-Storybook-in-apps precedent from apps/shell.\n\nVerified manually via dev server: both charts'' empty states and the\nbalance card render correctly with no hydration warnings for an\nunauthenticated request.","tree":{"sha":"c845360e11a5a21d7742dd4f2a276546575b12ba","url":