t)\nfrom the Server Component rather than self-fetching the local /api/statement\nroute — the local Next.js docs (backend-for-frontend.md, \"Caveats > Server\nComponents\") say to fetch data in Server Components directly from its\nsource, since self-fetching a Route Handler adds a needless round trip and\nfails outright during static generation. The route handler from the\nprevious commit remains available and independently tested for future\nclient-side consumers.\n\nBalanceCard is adapted from the Fase 01 version to the real API''s\nDebit/Credit shape via the new computeBalance helper (Credit adds, Debit\nsubtracts — value is always sent/received positive per design.md).","tree":{"sha":"62e597916de9cfd92cdffc6f9a5e21be465971a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leticiazaccaro/bytebank-app/git/trees/62e597916de9cfd92cdffc6f9a5e21be465971a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leticiazaccaro/bytebank-app/git/commits/ce877b64af07a6b3d9bd5d5536a6160f5f87839c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19177327?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leticiazaccaro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leticiazaccaro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leticiazaccaro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leticiazaccaro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leticiazaccaro","id":19177327,"login":"leticiazaccaro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTc3MzI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leticiazaccaro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leticiazaccaro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leticiazaccaro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leticiazaccaro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leticiazaccaro/subscript