://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madhukamath2000-lang/Cc-basket/commits/3c93bc78c7fdb69f816e801e84ccc55064f7b15b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T06:21:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T06:21:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: normalize iv=0 as unavailable; add T11/T12 IV regression tests\n\niv=0 from Upstox is not meaningful (0% implied volatility indicates\nmissing data, not a real value). Two-layer fix:\n- upstox-options.js: apply (rawIv != null && rawIv > 0) guard so the\n  server probe emits null for both absent and zero IV values\n- ccWriteAdvisory in index.html: same guard on best.iv before toFixed(),\n  so any iv=0 that reaches the client is also normalized to null\n- cc-advisory-tests.js: mirror the fix in the inline function copy;\n  add T11 (iv=0 → null, action unaffected) and T12 (missing option_greeks\n  entirely → null, action unaffected); all 29 assertions pass\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016Min9TFxQguFie2KwnkqEU","tree":{"sha":"44d92c405261b98b283b8b05c3c5579066bc722f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madhukamath2000-lang/Cc-basket/git/trees/44d92c405261b98b283b8b05c3c5579066bc722f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madhukamath2000-lang/Cc-basket/git/commits/3c93bc78c7fdb69f816e801e84ccc55064f7b15b","verification":{"payload":"tree 44d92c405261b98b283b8b05c3c5579066bc722f\nparent 96217fb499eed84f24c68dcca234c4da9f8f53e7\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783318877 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783318877 +0000\n\nfix: normalize iv=0 as unavailable; add T11/T12 IV regression tests\n\niv=0 from Upstox is not meaningful (0% implied volatility indicates\nmissing data, not a real value). Two-layer fix:\n- upstox-options.js: apply (rawIv != null && rawIv > 0) guard so the\n  server probe emits null for both absent and zero IV values\n- ccWriteAdvisory in index.html: same guard on best.iv before toFixed(),\n  so any iv=0 that reaches the client is also normalized to null\n- cc-advisory-tests.js: mirror the fix in the inline function copy;\n  add T11 (iv=0 → null, action unaffected) and T12 (missing option_greeks\n  entirely → null, action unaffected); all 29 assertions pass\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016Min9TFxQguFie2KwnkqEU\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCR8sBxU\nOuNeuJ/HRSCTVI+A3tku7ceOSFS0T9uibsZzU1u92s74s/dyhIAQiFC56mwJQX7CdwJyK2T9hlo3\nGAw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-06T06:21:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/madhukamath2000-lang/Cc-basket/commit/3c93bc78c7fdb69f816e801e84ccc55064f7b15b","node_id":"C_kwDOSViYitoAKDNjOTNiYzc4YzdmZGI2OWY4MTZlODAxZTg0Y2NjNTUwNjRmN2IxNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/madhukamath2000-lang/Cc-basket/commit/96217fb499eed84f24c68dcca234c4da9f8f53e7","sha":"96217fb499eed84f24c68dcca234c4da9f8f53e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madhukamath2000-lang/Cc-basket/commits/96217fb499eed84f24c68dcca234c4da9f8f53e7"}],"sha":"3c93bc78c7fdb69f816e801e84ccc55064f7b15b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madhukamath2000-lang/Cc-basket/commits/3c93bc78c7fdb69f816e801e84ccc55064f7b15b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madhukamath2000-lang/Cc-basket/commits/96217fb499eed84f24c68dcca234c4da9f8f53e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T06:13:57Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T06:13:57Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: resolve IV field location in Upstox v2 option chain response\n\nUpstox v2 /v2/option/chain places IV in option_greeks, not market_data.\nPrevious code read ce.iv from market_data which always returned null.\n\nupstox-options.js: probe all candidate paths in priority order —\n  1. option_greeks.iv           (Upstox v2 documented location)\n  2. option_greeks.implied_volatility  (alternative key name)\n  3. market_data.iv             (fallback if schema ever changes)\n  4. market_data.implied_volatility    (final fallback)\n  null if none found.\n\nindex.html: show \"IV unavailable\" row (muted) instead of hiding row\nentirely, so absence is visible not silent.\n\ncc-advisory-tests.js: T10b verifies null IV does not break advisory\naction (still WRITE_NOW). Total: 25/25 assertions passing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016Min9TFxQguFie2KwnkqEU","tree":{"sha":"c19f731bcbd7cbaf9ebbbbbf10bcea62438d821f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madhukamath2000-lang/Cc-basket/git/trees/c19f731bcbd7cbaf9ebbbbbf10bcea62438d821f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madhukamath2000-lang/Cc-basket/git/commits/96217fb499eed84f24c68dcca234c4da9f8f53e7","verification":{"payload":"tree c19f731bcbd7cbaf9ebbbbbf10bcea62438d821f\nparent a9ea87a49384343d6515269d5d769dc94bf3d2e0\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783318437 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783318437 +0000\n\nfix: resolve IV field location in Upstox v2 option chain response\n\nUpstox v2 /v2/option/chain places IV in option_greeks, not market_data.\nPrevious code read ce.iv from market_data which always returned null.\n\nupstox-options.js: probe all candidate paths in priority order —\n  1. option_greeks.iv           (Upstox v2 documented location)\n  2. option_greeks.implied_volatility  (alternative key name)\n  3. market_data.iv             (fallback if schema ever changes)\n  4. market_data.implied_volatility    (final fallback)\n  null if none found.\n\nindex.html: show \"IV unavailable\" row (muted) instead of hiding row\nentirely, so absence is visible not silent.\n\ncc-advisory-tests.js: T10b verifies null IV does not break advisory\naction (still WRITE_NOW). Total: 25/25 assertions passing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016Min9TFxQguFie2KwnkqEU\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQI9Xn5Sy\nYZGYQW00cWoiv2hVsuaL2xEKZ753IiUxOZoleLF1A2+S9VIt3hazLbZ3dYUBA2Rkt+wrHHvmW4/g\nPgY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-06T06:13:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/madhukamath2000-lang/Cc-basket/commit/96217fb499eed84f24c68dcca234c4da9f8f53e7","node_id":"C_kwDOSViYitoAKDk2MjE3ZmI0OTllZWQ4NGYyNGM2OGRjY2EyMzRjNGRhOWY4ZjUzZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"h