Candidates displays IMPLIED VOL (IV) row\nwhen Upstox provides the value.\n\ncc-advisory-tests.js: T10 verifies IV flows from chain data to advisory\nobject. Total assertions: 23/23 passing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016Min9TFxQguFie2KwnkqEU","tree":{"sha":"bed0c73c9ca422121648a13715a48096c64a84d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madhukamath2000-lang/Cc-basket/git/trees/bed0c73c9ca422121648a13715a48096c64a84d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madhukamath2000-lang/Cc-basket/git/commits/a9ea87a49384343d6515269d5d769dc94bf3d2e0","verification":{"payload":"tree bed0c73c9ca422121648a13715a48096c64a84d3\nparent d6191d6f3d46c79a54d41118ac7117030ca019d3\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783318042 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783318042 +0000\n\nfeat: add IV to option chain response and write candidate advisory\n\nupstox-options.js: extract ce.iv from Upstox market_data alongside\nltp/oi/prevClose; pass through as nullable to browser.\n\nindex.html: ccBestStrike propagates iv from winning strike; ccWriteAdvisory\nreturns iv field; renderWriteCandidates displays IMPLIED VOL (IV) row\nwhen Upstox provides the value.\n\ncc-advisory-tests.js: T10 verifies IV flows from chain data to advisory\nobject. Total assertions: 23/23 passing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016Min9TFxQguFie2KwnkqEU\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGDHmyMK\nzhBTbzgnwIjQAbsMGZsViofSUN5k3b4FOWJLQ9WfhxNF2wEgEgluZou12MCTXBEogBJuBJ0hF5Cb\n8Ac=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-06T06:07:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/