api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madhukamath2000-lang/Cc-basket/commits/d6191d6f3d46c79a54d41118ac7117030ca019d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T05:57:44Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T05:57:44Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: CC advisory engine — real-time covered-call decision support\n\nReplaces the fixed-rule CC scanner with a live data-driven advisory engine\nthat computes recommendations from Upstox option chain data on every refresh.\n\nWRITE CANDIDATES (all CC_UNIVERSE symbols)\n- ccBestStrike(): finds highest-premium CE in 5–8% OTM band\n- ccWriteAdvisory(): computes exact contract, entry range, chase limit,\n  SL (1.5× entry), premium/lot, annualised return, OTM%, capital required,\n  assignment risk, secondary-source validation flag\n- Action: WRITE_NOW (≥12% ann floor) | WAIT | DATA_MISSING | RECOMPUTE\n- Sorted by annualised return descending; renders as dark trade-plan cards\n\nOPEN POSITIONS (each CC_POSITIONS entry)\n- ccPositionAdvisory(): from live Upstox underlying + strikes + DTE\n  computes captured%, remaining ₹, remaining annualised yield, assignment\n  probability, best redeployment candidate\n- Decision engine (no fixed 80% rule):\n    CLOSE  → SL hit, or ≥90% captured (cost of carry > benefit)\n    WATCH  → within 10% of SL\n    ROLL   → spot within 2% of strike and DTE > 5\n    RECYCLE→ ≥70% captured AND fresh best_write > 1.5× remaining yield\n    EXTEND → DTE ≤ 5 with meaningful premium remaining\n    HOLD   → all other cases\n- Every action ships a numeric rationale string\n\nDATA DISCIPLINE\n- Advisory engine activates only when Upstox chain data is present\n- Falls back to last-known LTP display when chain data absent\n- Yahoo Finance secondary spot used only for staleness warning, never\n  as primary execution price (Upstox always wins)\n- _writeAdv and _posAdv reset to [] / {} at start of every loadCC()\n\nCONFIGURATION\n- CC_UNIVERSE: lot sizes and OTM range per symbol (all 7 Upstox symbols)\n- CC_CFG: thresholds loaded from localStorage cc_cfg key with safe defaults\n\nOTHER\n- sydneyNow(): explicit Australia/Sydney timezone for all timestamps\n- cc-advisory-tests.js: 21 assertions across 9 scenarios — all passing\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016Min9TFxQguFie2KwnkqEU","tree":{"sha":"c89c4a816c1f3f5aa2ef19e0ce08da6cf7ccfefc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madhukamath2000-lang/Cc-basket/git/trees/c89c4a816c1f3f5aa2ef19e0ce08da6cf7ccfefc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madhukamath2000-lang/Cc-basket/git/commits/d6191d6f3d46c79a54d41118ac7117030ca019d3","verification":{"payload":"tree c89c4a816c1f3f5aa2ef19e0ce08da6cf7ccfefc\nparent 00868d69904dc569394840f51b71bfe4b0d466e7\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783317464 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783317464 +0000\n\nfeat: CC advisory engine — real-time covered-call decision support\n\nReplaces the fixed-rule CC scanner with a live data-driven advisory engine\nthat computes recommendations from Upstox option chain data on every refresh.\n\nWRITE CANDIDATES (all CC_UNIVERSE symbols)\n- ccBestStrike(): finds highest-premium CE in 5–8% OTM band\n- ccWriteAdvisory(): computes exact contract, entry range, chase limit,\n  SL (1.5× entry), premium/lot, annualised return, OTM%, capital required,\n  assignment risk, secondary-source validation flag\n- Action: WRITE_NOW (≥12% ann floor) | WAIT | DATA_MISSING | RECOMPUTE\n- Sorted by annualised return descending; renders as dark trade-plan cards\n\nOPEN POSITIONS (each CC_POSITIONS entry)\n- ccPositionAdvisory(): from live Upstox underlying + strikes + DTE\n  computes captured%, remaining ₹, remaining annualised yield, assignment\n  probability, best redeployment candidate\n- Decision engine (no fixed 80% rule):\n    CLOSE  → SL hit, or ≥90% captured (cost of carry > benefit)\n    WATCH  → within 10% of SL\n    ROLL   → spot within 2% of strike and DTE > 5\n    RECYCLE→ ≥70% captured AND fresh best_write > 1.5× remaining yield\n    EXTEND → DTE ≤ 5 with meaningful premium remaining\n    HOLD   → all other cases\n- Every action ships a numeric rationale string\n\nDATA DISCIPLINE\n- Advisory engine activates only when Upstox chain data is present\n- Falls back to last-known LTP display when chain data absent\n- Yahoo Finance secondary spot used only for staleness warning, never\n  as primary execution price (Upstox always wins)\n- _writeAdv and _posAdv reset to [] / {} at start of every loadCC()\n\nCONFIGURATION\n- CC_UNIVERSE: lot sizes and OTM range per symbol (all 7 Upstox symbols)\n- CC_CFG: thresholds loaded from localStorage cc_cfg key with safe defaults\n\nOTHER\n- sydneyNow(): explicit Australia/Sydney timezone for all timestamps\n- cc-advisory-tests.js: 21 assertions across 9 scenarios — all passing\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016Min9TFxQguFie2KwnkqEU\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIPw0c0J\nE6TGrbjR9fzKg1HEldJ7Og1kHKfEcj0RblqFOCov/GSmS7/PIDHt8z7S+lOaNwijBkBGAD6p1ig9\nrgU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-06T05:57:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"h