","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madhukamath2000-lang/Cc-basket/commits/00868d69904dc569394840f51b71bfe4b0d466e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T15:58:20Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T15:58:20Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add ADR-000 (Project Philosophy) and index to DECISIONS.md\n\nInserts ADR-000 as the foundational entry before all existing ADRs.\nADR-000 documents the 10 enduring engineering principles that govern\nevery architectural decision in the project: reliability over feature\ncount, simplicity over complexity, evidence over assumptions,\ntransparency, documentation as product, incremental improvement,\nroot-cause fixes, production stability first, security by default,\nand decision documentation before forgetting.\n\nAlso adds a full index table at the top of the file linking all\n19 ADRs (ADR-000 through ADR-018) by anchor for fast navigation.","tree":{"sha":"773202f73e00497de538706321682f885b3936a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madhukamath2000-lang/Cc-basket/git/trees/773202f73e00497de538706321682f885b3936a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madhukamath2000-lang/Cc-basket/git/commits/00868d69904dc569394840f51b71bfe4b0d466e7","verification":{"payload":"tree 773202f73e00497de538706321682f885b3936a1\nparent d312ef4c0094c949cc28eacac02809d8227295be\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783180700 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783180700 +0000\n\nAdd ADR-000 (Project Philosophy) and index to DECISIONS.md\n\nInserts ADR-000 as the foundational entry before all existing ADRs.\nADR-000 documents the 10 enduring engineering principles that govern\nevery architectural decision in the project: reliability over feature\ncount, simplicity over complexity, evidence over assumptions,\ntransparency, documentation as product, incremental improvement,\nroot-cause fixes, production stability first, security by default,\nand decision documentation before forgetting.\n\nAlso adds a full index table at the top of the file linking all\n19 ADRs (ADR-000 through ADR-018) by anchor for fast navigation.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGXh9+Mc\nhOXYX8SmqIVN0S1zhQq3mSClCPf1dKQalcyE0l0qVN53+XgoCjBNHo8xm2++zJL0t5EwqbYgjyz1\noAc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-04T15:58:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/madhukamath2000-lang/Cc-basket/commit/00868d69904dc569394840f51b71bfe4b0d466e7","node_id":"C_kwDOSViYitoAKDAwODY4ZDY5OTA0ZGM1NjkzOTQ4NDBmNTFiNzFiZmU0YjBkNDY2ZTc","parents