ramework SPA, Cloudflare Pages over a backend server,\nPages Functions co-location, single-file index.html, no build step, client-side\nPIN gate, AES-256-GCM token encryption, localStorage persistence, key prefix\nand versioning conventions, three-tier LTP fallback, x-upstox-token header\npattern, hardcoded positions, UNDERLYINGS map, the p.live flag reset fix,\nsequential NSE fetches, public edge caching, and optional AI briefing.","tree":{"sha":"b1a6649181c99bd09868ddce8490df5d4fdb7d53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madhukamath2000-lang/Cc-basket/git/trees/b1a6649181c99bd09868ddce8490df5d4fdb7d53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madhukamath2000-lang/Cc-basket/git/commits/d312ef4c0094c949cc28eacac02809d8227295be","verification":{"payload":"tree b1a6649181c99bd09868ddce8490df5d4fdb7d53\nparent aab5ee1ef0810cd493065aed90ce5b766c6c45bf\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783179821 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783179821 +0000\n\nAdd DECISIONS.md — architectural decision record\n\n18 ADRs covering every significant architectural choice in the project:\nADR-001 through ADR-018, each with decision, context, alternatives considered,\nrationale, trade-offs, date, and future review criteria.\n\nTopics include: no-framework SPA, Cloudflare Pages over a backend server,\nPages Functions co-location, single-file index.html, no build step, client-side\nPIN gate, AES-256-GCM token encryption, localStorage persistence, key prefix\nand versioning conventions, three-tier LTP fallback, x-upstox-token header\npattern, hardcoded positions, UNDERLYINGS map, the p.live flag reset fix,\nsequential NSE fetches, public edge caching, and optional AI briefing.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGSXnlFr\nakoKjdpCZrRTeWghFWUnQe5VZXzWqT6U0UnqXJMVNUbDVbtvupmtuGQIPdnXrcueDuecOzOzVuu2\nbwg=\n